<h2 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-A.ProjectHead">A. Project Head</h2>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-ProjectHead=E2=80=93RoleOverview"><strong>Project He=
ad =E2=80=93 Role Overview</strong></h3>
<p>The <strong>Project Head</strong> is a key administrative authority with=
in the VBSA Mega platform, responsible for overseeing the lifecycle of proj=
ects and subprojects. All actions are governed by role-based access and req=
uire approval from designated authorities.</p>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-ResponsibilitiesandFunctionalScope"><strong>Responsi=
bilities and Functional Scope</strong></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Project Creation &amp; Configuration</strong></p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Project-Venue Mapping</strong></p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Audit Management</strong></p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<div id=3D"expander-569163856" class=3D"expand-container">
<div id=3D"expander-control-569163856" class=3D"expand-control">
<span class=3D"expand-control-icon"><img style=3D"vertical-align:middle;" c=
lass=3D"expand-control-image" src=3D"f21dae11798d2af9ea1168a5798afeb45451aa=
fce182619f3dbe43f2e8b53628" width=3D"16" height=3D"16"></span><span class=
=3D"expand-control-text">1. Create Projects and Subprojects</span>
</div>
<div id=3D"expander-content-569163856" class=3D"expand-content">
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-1.Interface:"><strong>1. Interface:</strong></h3>
<p>Project Creation and Management Screens</p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-2.Role:"><strong>2. Role:</strong></h3>
<p>Project Head</p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-3.Description:"><strong>3. Description:</strong></h3=
>
<p>This functionality allows the <strong>Project Head</strong> to create an=
d manage <strong>Projects</strong> and <strong>Subprojects</strong> within =
the VBSA Mega Project system. The interface provides a structured form to c=
onfigure project details, resource requirements, scheduling, and audit pref=
erences. Subprojects can be created under a parent project and managed inde=
pendently in terms of availability and venue mapping.</p>
<h4 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-FunctionalRequirements:"><strong>Functional Requirem=
ents:</strong></h4>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Project Creation Form Includes:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Project Short Name</strong> <em>(Mandatory)</em></p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Project Name</strong> <em>(Mandatory)</em></p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Project Logo Upload</strong> <em>(Supported formats: JPG, JPEG, =
WebP)</em></p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Full Venue Required?</strong> <em>(Yes/No toggle)</em></p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Resource Type</strong> <em>(Multi-select: Classroom, Computer La=
b)</em></p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Short Description</strong> <em>(Max 100 words)</em></p></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Audit Requirement Options:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Comprehensive Audit</p></li>
<li>
<p>Limited Audit</p></li>
<li>
<p>By-pass Audit</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Scheduling Configuration:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Project Date Range</strong>: Start Date to End Date</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Recurring Days</strong>: Checkboxes for each day of the week</p>=
</li>
<li>
<p><strong>Slot Type</strong>:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Full Day</p></li>
<li>
<p>Time Slot</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Add multiple <strong>Date Slots</strong> with:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Start Date =E2=80=93 End Date</p></li>
<li>
<p>Duration (Hours and Minutes)</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul></li>
</ul></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Actions Available:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Discard</p></li>
<li>
<p>Save as Draft</p></li>
<li>
<p>Submit</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Subproject Creation:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Subprojects can be created under a parent project.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Inherits attributes from the parent but allows customization of:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Resource types</p></li>
<li>
<p>Scheduling</p></li>
<li>
<p>Audit requirements</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-4.Trigger:"><strong>4. Trigger:</strong></h3>
<p>Manual initiation by the Project Head</p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-5.Pre-Condition:"><strong>5. Pre-Condition:</strong>=
</h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>The Project Head must be onboarded via the <strong>PeopleStrong utility<=
/strong>.</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-6.Post-Condition:"><strong>6. Post-Condition:</stron=
g></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Projects and subprojects are created and stored in the system.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Projects are available for review and approval by designated authorities=
.</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-7.BusinessRules:"><strong>7. Business Rules:</strong=
></h3>
<ol start=3D"1">
<li>
<p>Only users with the <strong>Project Head</strong> role can create projec=
ts and subprojects.</p></li>
<li>
<p>All projects and subprojects must be <strong>mandatorily approved</stron=
g> by:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Operations Head</strong></p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Government MDM Administrator</strong></p></li>
</ul></li>
</ol>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-8.Integration:"><strong>8. Integration:</strong></h3=
>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Government MDM</strong>: For project validation and approval wor=
kflows</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>SSO (Single Sign-On)</strong>: For secure authentication and rol=
e-based access</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-9.Screens:"><strong>9. Screens:</strong></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Image 1</strong>: Project listing and management dashboard</p></=
li>
<li>
<p><strong>Image 2 &amp; 3</strong>: Project creation form interface</p></l=
i>
