<span class=3D"expand-control-icon"><img style=3D"vertical-align:middle;" c=
lass=3D"expand-control-image" src=3D"f21dae11798d2af9ea1168a5798afeb45451aa=
fce182619f3dbe43f2e8b53628" width=3D"16" height=3D"16"></span><span class=
=3D"expand-control-text">2. Mapping of Projects and Subprojects to Venues</=
span>
</div>
<div id=3D"expander-content-837738410" class=3D"expand-content">
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-1.Interface:.1"><strong>1. Interface:</strong></h3>
<p>Project-Venue Mapping Page</p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-2.Role"><strong>2. Role</strong></h3>
<p><strong>Project Head</strong></p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-3.FunctionalOverview"><strong>3. Functional Overview=
</strong></h3>
<p>This module allows the Project Head to view all approved projects and su=
bprojects and initiate venue mapping based on resource requirements. The ma=
pping process is designed to be both manual and intelligent, offering flexi=
bility and automation through smart suggestions and system-driven resource =
calculations.</p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-UserInterfaceComponents"><strong>User Interface Comp=
onents</strong></h3>
<h4 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-1.Project-SubprojectListingPage"><strong>1. Project-=
Subproject Listing Page</strong></h4>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Accessible via the <strong>=E2=80=9CVenue Mapping=E2=80=9D</strong> tab =
in the sidebar.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Displays a searchable and filterable list of all <strong>approved projec=
ts and subprojects</strong>.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Columns include:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Type (Project / Subproject)</p></li>
<li>
<p>Name</p></li>
<li>
<p>Resource Type (Classroom / Computer Lab)</p></li>
<li>
<p>Slot Type (Full Day / Time Slots)</p></li>
<li>
<p>Full Venue Required (Yes / No)</p></li>
<li>
<p>Start Date =E2=80=93 End Date</p></li>
<li>
<p>Status (Pending / Approved)</p></li>
<li>
<p>Actions (Initiate Mapping)</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<h4 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-2.District-WiseVenueMappingPage"><strong>2. District=
-Wise Venue Mapping Page</strong></h4>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Triggered by selecting a project/subproject from the listing.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Header Section</strong>: Displays selected project/subproject de=
tails.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>District Accordions</strong>:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Each accordion represents a district.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Lists available venues with infrastructure and resource offerings.</p></=
li>
<li>
<p>Accordion header shows total resources offered per district.</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-MappingWorkflow"><strong>Mapping Workflow</strong></=
h3>
<h4 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-Step1:SeatRequirementConfiguration"><strong>Step 1: =
Seat Requirement Configuration</strong></h4>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Manual Entry</strong>: Project Head inputs the number of seats r=
equired per district.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Smart Suggest Toggle</strong>:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>When enabled, the system calls an external API using project parameters.=
</p></li>
<li>
<p>API returns seat requirements per district.</p></li>
<li>
<p>System auto-calculates required resources.</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<h4 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-Step2:Auto-SelectionofVenues"><strong>Step 2: Auto-S=
election of Venues</strong></h4>
<ul>
<li>
<p>System selects venues that:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Match the required resource type.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Provide <strong>20% buffer</strong> over the required seats.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Automatically checks venue selection boxes.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Updates =E2=80=9CResources Offered=E2=80=9D count in the accordion heade=
r.</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<h4 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-Step3:ManualOverride"><strong>Step 3: Manual Overrid=
e</strong></h4>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Project Head can:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Deselect auto-selected venues.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Manually select alternative venues based on preference or availability.<=
/p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<h4 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-Step4:Finalization"><strong>Step 4: Finalization</st=
rong></h4>
<ul>
<li>
<p>After mapping venues for all districts:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Project Head clicks <strong>=E2=80=9CMap &amp; Submit=E2=80=9D</strong>.=
</p></li>
<li>
<p>Venue selections are sent for approval.</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-4.FunctionalRequirements"><strong>4. Functional Requ=
irements</strong></h3>
<h4 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-VenueMetadata"><strong>Venue Metadata</strong></h4>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Venue Code, Name, Email, Contact, Address</p></li>
<li>
<p>Resource Types: Computer Lab / Classroom</p></li>
<li>
<p>Infrastructure Details: Safety, Power Backup, etc.</p></li>
</ul>
<h4 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-ProjectMappingConfiguration"><strong>Project Mapping=
 Configuration</strong></h4>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Select Project/Subproject</p></li>
<li>
<p>Define Start Date and End Date</p></li>
<li>
<p>Select Recurring Days (Sun to Sat)</p></li>
<li>
<p>Choose Slot Type: Full Day / Time Slots</p></li>
<li>
<p>Configure Break Time</p></li>
<li>
<p>Toggle for Full Venue Required</p></li>
<li>
<p>Select Required Resource Type</p></li>
<li>
<p>Resource Availability:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Computers Available / Offered</p></li>
<li>
<p>Buffers Available / Offered</p></li>
<li>
<p>Total Offered</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-5.Triggers"><strong>5. Triggers</strong></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Initiated when a project or subproject is approved through the maker-che=
cker flow.</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-6.Pre-Conditions"><strong>6. Pre-Conditions</strong>=
</h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Project/Subproject must be approved.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Venue details must be published by Venue Owners.</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-7.Post-Conditions"><strong>7. Post-Conditions</stron=
g></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Project Head receives:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>District-wise venue and resource availability</p></li>
<li>
<p>Auto-selected venues based on resource logic</p></li>
<li>
<p>Option to override selections</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-8.BusinessRules"><strong>8. Business Rules</strong><=
/h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Mapping must respect resource type and availability constraints.</p></li=
>
<li>
<p>Auto-selection includes 20% buffer.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Manual override is permitted before submission.</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-9.Integration"><strong>9. Integration</strong></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Government MDM</strong>: Sync venue data for validation and comp=
liance.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>SSO (Single Sign-On)</strong>: For secure authentication and rol=
e-based access.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>External API</strong>: For Smart Suggest seat calculation.</p></=
li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-10.Screens:"><strong>10. Screens:</strong></h3>
<p>Image-1: Project &amp; Subproject Listing</p><span class=3D"confluence-e=
mbedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size">=
