</div>
<div id=3D"expander-content-1943983990" class=3D"expand-content">
<p><span class=3D"inline-comment-marker" data-ref=3D"e5cb4b81-d122-4fe3-a49=
0-771725fe57a6">Need to check with RK sir: Multi-instance is not supported =
on MDM/RBAC/SSO. Suggestion is that users specifically Project Head and few=
 people managing venue be onboarded and mapped using a super project manage=
r role.</span></p>
</div>
</div>
<div id=3D"expander-586963415" class=3D"expand-container">
<div id=3D"expander-control-586963415" class=3D"expand-control">
<span class=3D"expand-control-icon"><img style=3D"vertical-align:middle;" c=
lass=3D"expand-control-image" src=3D"f21dae11798d2af9ea1168a5798afeb45451aa=
fce182619f3dbe43f2e8b53628" width=3D"16" height=3D"16"></span><span class=
=3D"expand-control-text">4. Audit Management</span>
</div>
<div id=3D"expander-content-586963415" class=3D"expand-content">
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-1.Interface:.2"><strong>1. Interface:</strong></h3>
<p>Audit Management page</p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-2.Role.1"><strong>2. Role</strong></h3>
<p><strong>Project Head</strong></p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-3.FunctionalOverview.1"><strong>3.Functional Overvie=
w</strong></h3>
<p>Audit Management enables the Project Head to:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Assign Venue Auditors to mapped venues.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Monitor audit progress and statuses.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Review and compare venue details submitted by Venue Owners and Venue Aud=
itors.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Approve or reject audits.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Analyze district-wise resource availability post-audit.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Receive system notifications for resource deficits.</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-UserInterfaceComponents.1"><strong>User Interface Co=
mponents</strong></h3>
<h4 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-1.AuditManagementListingPage"><strong>1. Audit Manag=
ement Listing Page</strong></h4>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Accessible via the <strong>=E2=80=9CAudit Management=E2=80=9D</strong> t=
ab in the sidebar.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Project/Subproject Dropdown</strong>: Lists only those projects/=
subprojects that are:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Approved via maker-checker flow.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Have approved venue mappings.</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Search Bar</strong>: Filter venues by code or name.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Export Button</strong>: Export audit data.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Status Filters</strong>: All, Pending, Auditor Assigned, Audited=
, Rejected, Approved.</p></li>
</ul>
<h5 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-TableColumns"><strong>Table Columns</strong></h5>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Venue Code</p></li>
<li>
<p>Venue Name</p></li>
<li>
<p>District Code</p></li>
<li>
<p>Location</p></li>
<li>
<p>Resource Types (Classroom / Computer Lab)</p></li>
<li>
<p>Resource Details (Seats, Computers)</p></li>
<li>
<p>Auditor Assigned (Name, Email)</p></li>
<li>
<p>Previously Audited (Yes/No)</p></li>
<li>
<p>Status Date</p></li>
<li>
<p>Actions:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Assign Auditor</strong></p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Compare Audit</strong></p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>View Audit Details</strong></p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-AuditAssignmentWorkflow"><strong>Audit Assignment Wo=
rkflow</strong></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Project Head selects a project/subproject.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Venue list is displayed.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Auditor is assigned per venue.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Audit status transitions:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Pending =E2=86=92 Auditor Assigned =E2=86=92 Audited =E2=86=92 Approved/=
Rejected</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-AuditComparisonPage"><strong>Audit Comparison Page</=
strong></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Accessed via <strong>=E2=80=9CCompare=E2=80=9D</strong> button in Action=
s column.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Displays side-by-side comparison:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Venue Admin Version</strong>: Original data from Venue Owner.</p=
></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Last Auditor Version</strong>: Data from Venue Auditor.</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p>Includes:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Venue Name</p></li>
<li>
<p>Category</p></li>
<li>
<p>Email, Phone</p></li>
<li>
<p>Main Gate Image</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Filter Options</strong>:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Show All Mismatches</p></li>
<li>
<p>Show All Critical Mismatches</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Actions</strong>:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Approve Audit</p></li>
<li>
<p>Reject Audit</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-District-WiseResourceView(ToggleFeature)"><strong>Di=
strict-Wise Resource View (Toggle Feature)</strong></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Toggle Button</strong> beside project/subproject dropdown.</p></=
li>
<li>
<p>When enabled:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Venue list view transforms into <strong>district-wise accordion view</st=
rong>.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Displays:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Resources Required</p></li>
<li>
<p>Resources Audited &amp; Approved</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p>Helps Project Head assess:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Deficit</strong>: Triggers remapping of venues.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Surplus</strong>: Indicates extra resources available for client=
 bookings.</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-SystemNotifications"><strong>System Notifications</s=
trong></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>After each audit approval:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>System checks for resource deficits.</p></li>
<li>
<p>If deficit exists:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>In-system notification</strong> is triggered to Project Head.</p=
></li>
<li>
<p>Includes:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Project/Subproject name</p></li>
<li>
<p>District code</p></li>
<li>
<p>Deficit details</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-4.FunctionalRequirements.1"><strong>4. Functional Re=
quirements</strong></h3>
<h4 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-AuditMetadata"><strong>Audit Metadata</strong></h4>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Venue Code, Name, District, Location</p></li>
<li>
<p>Resource Types and Quantities</p></li>
<li>
<p>Auditor Details</p></li>
<li>
<p>Audit Status and Dates</p></li>
</ul>
<h4 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-AuditActions"><strong>Audit Actions</strong></h4>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Assign Auditor</p></li>
<li>
<p>Compare Audit</p></li>
<li>
<p>Approve / Reject Audit</p></li>
</ul>
<h4 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-ResourceAnalysis"><strong>Resource Analysis</strong>=
</h4>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Required vs. Audited Resources</p></li>
<li>
<p>District-wise summary</p></li>
<li>
<p>Toggle-based view transformation</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-5.Triggers.1"><strong>5. Triggers</strong></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Initiated after:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Project/Subproject approval</p></li>
<li>
<p>Venue mapping approval</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-6.Pre-Conditions.1"><strong>6. Pre-Conditions</stron=
g></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Project/Subproject must be approved.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Mapped venues must be approved.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Venue Auditor must be available in the system.</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-7.Post-Conditions.1"><strong>7. Post-Conditions</str=
ong></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Audit status updated per venue.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Resource availability recalculated.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Notifications sent for deficits.</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-8.BusinessRules.1"><strong>8. Business Rules</strong=
></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Only approved projects/subprojects are eligible for audit.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Audit comparison must be completed before approval.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Deficit triggers remapping; surplus informs availability.</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-9.Integration.1"><strong>9. Integration</strong></h3=
>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>SSO</strong>: Secure login and role-based access.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Notification Engine</strong>: For in-system alerts.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Audit Logging</strong>: Tracks all audit actions and decisions.<=
/p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-10.Screens:.1"><strong>10. Screens:</strong></h3>
<ol start=3D"1">
<li>
<p>Venue listing for a project or subproject</p></li>
