<div id=3D"expander-947912190" class=3D"expand-container">
<div id=3D"expander-control-947912190" class=3D"expand-control">
<span class=3D"expand-control-icon"><img style=3D"vertical-align:middle;" c=
lass=3D"expand-control-image" src=3D"f21dae11798d2af9ea1168a5798afeb45451aa=
fce182619f3dbe43f2e8b53628" width=3D"16" height=3D"16"></span><span class=
=3D"expand-control-text">5. Venue Details</span>
</div>
<div id=3D"expander-content-947912190" class=3D"expand-content">
<p><strong>1. Interfaces Covered:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Venue Listing Page</p></li>
<li>
<p>Venue Details Page (Read-only)</p></li>
<li>
<p>Venue Calendar View (Read-only)</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-2.Role:.1"><strong>2. Role:</strong></h3>
<p><strong>Project Head</strong><br>
(With <strong>read-only access</strong> to all venue-related data)</p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-3.Description:.1"><strong>3. Description:</strong></=
h3>
<p>This module allows the <strong>Project Head</strong> to access and <stro=
ng>view</strong> all venue-related information in the VBSA portal. The user=
 can:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>View venue listings</p></li>
<li>
<p>View full venue details</p></li>
<li>
<p>View venue booking calendar and availability</p></li>
<li>
<p>Export venue lists</p></li>
</ul>
<p>No editing, disabling, or scheduling functionality is available for this=
 role.</p>
<hr>
<h2 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-SECTIONA:VenueListingPage"><strong>SECTION A: Venue =
Listing Page</strong></h2>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-4.AccessPoint:"><strong>4. Access Point:</strong></h=
3>
<p>Menu: <strong>Dashboard =E2=86=92 Venue Details</strong></p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-5.FunctionalOverview:"><strong>5. Functional Overvie=
w:</strong></h3>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"59d3b1be-00e7-4eb6-9167-3c1=
d2bacb193" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<colgroup>
<col style=3D"width: 177.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 553.0px;">
</colgroup>
<tbody>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Feature</p></th>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Description</p></th>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Tabs</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Filter venues by: <strong>All</strong>, <strong>Active</strong>, <strong=
>Inactive</strong></p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Search</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Search by <strong>Venue Code</strong>, <strong>District Code</strong>, o=
r <strong>Venue Name</strong></p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Filters</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Open advanced filter panel (year)</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Export</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Download currently visible venues in CSV/Excel</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Pagination</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>=E2=80=9CShow More=E2=80=9D and navigation arrows</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Table View</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Lists all venues with sortable columns (e.g., Code, Status, Seats)</p></=
td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Actions</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>View Calendar, View Venue Details, Disable</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-6.TableColumns:"><strong>6. Table Columns:</strong><=
/h3>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"dac34dd1-6108-40b0-a41b-fbe=
b0f2a9ec9" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<colgroup>
<col style=3D"width: 177.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 553.0px;">
</colgroup>
<tbody>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Column</p></th>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Description</p></th>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Checkbox</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Selectable (only for visual purposes =E2=80=93 no bulk actions)</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Venue Code</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Unique code for the venue</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>District Code</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Code for the district</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
