<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Hyperlinked project codes</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Actions</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Calendar View and Venue Details View</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-7.BusinessRules(ListingPage):"><strong>7. Business R=
ules (Listing Page):</strong></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>All columns are <strong>non-editable</strong>.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Status cannot be changed by Project Head.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Actions are limited to viewing only.</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h2 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-SECTIONB:VenueDetailsPage(Read-only)"><strong>SECTIO=
N B: Venue Details Page (Read-only)</strong></h2>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-8.AccessPoint:"><strong>8. Access Point:</strong></h=
3>
<p>Venue Listing Page =E2=86=92 Click on <strong>View (Eye)</strong> Icon</=
p>
<p>Displays complete venue details in a structured <strong>form view</stron=
g>. The form is <strong>read-only</strong> for the Project Head and is used=
 for reference only.</p>
<hr>
<h2 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-SECTIONC:VenueCalendarView(Read-only)"><strong>SECTI=
ON C: Venue Calendar View (Read-only)</strong></h2>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-11.AccessPoint:"><strong>11. Access Point:</strong><=
/h3>
<p>Venue Listing Page =E2=86=92 Click on <strong>Calendar</strong> Icon (pe=
r row)</p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-12.FunctionalOverview:"><strong>12. Functional Overv=
iew:</strong></h3>
<p>Displays the <strong>venue=E2=80=99s availability calendar</strong>. The=
 user can:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>View <strong>booked</strong>, <strong>available</strong>, and <strong>bl=
ocked</strong> dates</p></li>
<li>
<p>View available date ranges and the slots configured by Venue Owner</p></=
li>
<li>
<p>View full-day or time-slot-based availability</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-13.Features&amp;Interactions:"><strong>13. Features =
&amp; Interactions:</strong></h3>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"191c77bf-6bc4-44ad-91b5-ca3=
e4c15496a" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<colgroup>
<col style=3D"width: 206.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 524.0px;">
</colgroup>
<tbody>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Feature</p></th>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Description</p></th>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Calendar Grid</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Monthly view with day status: Available (green), Booked (red), Blocked (=
yellow)</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Navigation</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Month-wise navigation (left/right arrows)</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Legend</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Indicates status types</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Slot Type Selection</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Dropdown: Full Day / Time Slot</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Slot Time Viewer</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Shows specific available/booked slots for selected days</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-14.BusinessRules(CalendarView):"><strong>14. Busines=
s Rules (Calendar View):</strong></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>No scheduling, booking, or blocking allowed</p></li>
<li>
<p>All interactions are <strong>view-only</strong></p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h2 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-15.TriggerPoints"><strong>15. Trigger Points</strong=
></h2>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"b8f045af-f872-487e-bcbd-da3=
98eda0f95" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<colgroup>
<col style=3D"width: 212.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 518.0px;">
</colgroup>
<tbody>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Trigger</p></th>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Result</p></th>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Clicking =E2=80=9CView=E2=80=9D icon</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Opens venue details in read-only form</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Clicking =E2=80=9CCalendar=E2=80=9D icon</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Opens calendar for that venue</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Using filters or search</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Updates venue listing in real time</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Export action</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Triggers file download of visible venue data</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<hr>
<h2 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-16.Pre-Conditions:"><strong>16. Pre-Conditions:</str=
ong></h2>
<ul>
<li>
<p>User must be logged in with <strong>Project Head</strong> role</p></li>
<li>
<p>Venues should exist in the system and be accessible via API/backend</p><=
/li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h2 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-17.Post-Conditions:"><strong>17. Post-Conditions:</s=
trong></h2>
<ul>
<li>
<p>No modifications made by the user</p></li>
<li>
<p>Logs may be created for =E2=80=9CView=E2=80=9D actions if audit logging =
is enabled</p></li>
<li>
<p>Data remains consistent and secure as per RBAC settings</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
