<span class=3D"expand-control-icon"><img style=3D"vertical-align:middle;" c=
lass=3D"expand-control-image" src=3D"f21dae11798d2af9ea1168a5798afeb45451aa=
fce182619f3dbe43f2e8b53628" width=3D"16" height=3D"16"></span><span class=
=3D"expand-control-text">6. Manage Users</span>
</div>
<div id=3D"expander-content-810979798" class=3D"expand-content">
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-1.Interface:.3"><strong>1. Interface:</strong></h3>
<p><strong>Manage Users Page</strong></p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-2.Role:.2"><strong>2. Role:</strong></h3>
<p><strong>Project Head</strong><br>
(Able to view and manage user activation status for projects created by the=
 Project Head only)</p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-3.Description:.2"><strong>3. Description:</strong></=
h3>
<p>The <strong>Manage Users</strong> screen enables a <strong>Project Head<=
/strong> to view all the <strong>approved users</strong> (Venue Owners, Ven=
ue Managers, and Auditors) who are associated with their assigned projects.=
<br>
The Project Head can:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>View user details</strong></p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Enable or Disable user access</strong> to their own projects<br>
This does <strong>not</strong> impact users globally for the projects creat=
ed by other Project Heads.</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-4.AccessPoint:.1"><strong>4. Access Point:</strong><=
/h3>
<p>Main Sidebar =E2=86=92 <strong>Manage Users</strong></p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-5.FunctionalOverview:.1"><strong>5. Functional Overv=
iew:</strong></h3>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"498a4628-9248-44f7-a8df-587=
79ac49c4a" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<colgroup>
<col style=3D"width: 156.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 574.0px;">
</colgroup>
<tbody>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Feature</p></th>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Description</p></th>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Tabs</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Filter by <strong>All</strong>, <strong>Active</strong>, or <strong>Inac=
tive</strong> users</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Search Bar</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Search users by <strong>email address</strong></p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Filters Button</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Opens advanced filter options (e.g., by role, projects)</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Table Display</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Lists all relevant users (approved &amp; associated with user=E2=80=99s =
projects)</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Actions Column</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>View</strong> user profile (read-only)- <strong>Enable</strong> =
or <strong>Disable</strong> user for the projects</p></li>
</ul></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Pagination</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>=E2=80=9CPagination=E2=80=9D controls and =E2=80=9CShow More=E2=80=9D na=
vigation</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-6.TableColumns:.1"><strong>6. Table Columns:</strong=
></h3>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"e4f41855-8aa9-44f3-8f22-933=
a043a17fa" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<colgroup>
<col style=3D"width: 157.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 573.0px;">
</colgroup>
<tbody>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Column</p></th>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Description</p></th>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Sr. No</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Auto-generated serial number</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Date</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Date of user creation or mapping to project</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>User Name</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Full name of the user</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Role Name</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>One of: Venue Owner / Venue Manager / Auditor</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Contact</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Phone number</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Email</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Email ID of the user</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Actions</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>View button and toggle for Enable/Disable</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-7.UserActions:"><strong>7. User Actions:</strong></h=
3>
<h4 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-ViewIcon:"><strong>View Icon:</strong></h4>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Opens a <strong>read-only popup</strong> with detailed user profile info=
:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Name, Role, Contact, Email</p></li>
<li>
<p>Project(s) the user is mapped to</p></li>
<li>
<p>Venue(s) the user is associated with (if any)</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<h4 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-Enable/DisableToggle:"><strong>Enable / Disable Togg=
le:</strong></h4>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Used to <strong>activate</strong> or <strong>deactivate</strong> the use=
r for the current <strong>Project Head=E2=80=99s scope</strong></p></li>
<li>
<p>Tooltip or confirmation shown before action</p></li>
<li>
<p>Action restricted to users under the Project Head=E2=80=99s authority</p=
></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-8.BusinessRules:"><strong>8. Business Rules:</strong=
></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Project Head can <strong>only manage</strong> users assigned to <strong>=
their projects</strong></p></li>
<li>
<p>The <strong>Enable/Disable</strong> action applies <strong>only to their=
 project context</strong></p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Global user status</strong> (across other projects) remains unaf=
fected</p></li>
<li>
<p>Users already inactive across all projects should appear as <strong>Inac=
tive</strong></p></li>
<li>
<p>At least one action (view or toggle) must be available if a user is mapp=
ed to any project</p></li>
<li>
<p>View access shows full user details but disables editing</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Disabled users cannot login or take actions in the context of th=
is project</strong></p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-9.TriggerPoints:"><strong>9. Trigger Points:</strong=
></h3>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"1d486f91-f17c-49b1-b2aa-33c=
e85c4d80b" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Trigger</p></th>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Outcome</p></th>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Click on <strong>View</strong> icon</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Read-only user profile popup</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Click on <strong>Enable/Disable</strong> icon</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>User access toggled for the Project Head=E2=80=99s scope</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Search by email</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Filters table data</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Filter by role/status</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Updates the listing in real-time</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-10.Pre-Conditions:"><strong>10. Pre-Conditions:</str=
ong></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Project Head is logged in with a valid session</p></li>
<li>
<p>Users must be pre-approved and assigned to one or more projects</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-11.Post-Conditions:"><strong>11. Post-Conditions:</s=
trong></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Changes in user access status are recorded for the current project only<=
/p></li>
<li>
<p>Access control reflects immediately in the user=E2=80=99s login and acti=
ons</p></li>
<li>
<p>Audit logs (if implemented) will capture enable/disable action</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-12.IntegrationPoints:"><strong>12. Integration Point=
s:</strong></h3>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"2d789942-77fa-4112-9196-447=
d656b525e" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>System</p></th>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Purpose</p></th>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>User Management Service</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Source of user roles, contacts, and mapping</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Project Role Mapping</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Determines project-specific user access</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>RBAC Module</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Enforces Project Head-level permissions</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Audit Service (optional)</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Logs view or toggle actions for tracking</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-13.ScreensReferenced:"><strong>13. Screens Reference=
d:</strong></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Image:</strong> Manage Users screen (attached screenshot)</p></l=
i>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
<hr>
<h2 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-B.VenueOwner">B. Venue Owner</h2>
<p>The <strong>Venue Owner</strong> is a key operational user responsible f=
or registering and managing venues on the VBSA Mega platform. This role inc=
ludes configuring venue details, authorizing managers or agents, setting av=
ailability by day and shift, uploading and approving contract terms, and ha=
ndling booking change requests. Venue Owners also manage services and prici=
ng, and facilitate direct bookings through seat blocking and contract coord=
ination with clients.</p>
<div id=3D"expander-1832105010" class=3D"expand-container">
<div id=3D"expander-control-1832105010" class=3D"expand-control">
<span class=3D"expand-control-icon"><img style=3D"vertical-align:middle;" c=
lass=3D"expand-control-image" src=3D"f21dae11798d2af9ea1168a5798afeb45451aa=
fce182619f3dbe43f2e8b53628" width=3D"16" height=3D"16"></span><span class=
=3D"expand-control-text">1. Registers Self</span>
</div>
<div id=3D"expander-content-1832105010" class=3D"expand-content">
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-1.Interface:.4"><strong>1. Interface:</strong></h3>
<p><strong>Registration Screen</strong></p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-2.Role:.3"><strong>2. Role:</strong></h3>
<p><strong>Venue Owner</strong></p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-3.Description:.3"><strong>3. Description:</strong></=
h3>
<p>This functionality allows individuals who own or manage venues to regist=
er themselves as Venue Owners on the VBSA portal. The registration process =
is initiated manually and includes the following steps:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Access Point:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>User visits the Home Page and clicks on =E2=80=9CList your offerings=E2=
=80=9D.</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Registration Page:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>The user is presented with three options:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Venue Owner (default selected)</p></li>
<li>
<p>Service Provider</p></li>
<li>
<p>Venue Manager</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p><strong>The user fills out the registration form with the following fiel=
ds:</strong></p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"ad8edafa-eca1-4577-958b-284=
c36a90236" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<colgroup>
<col style=3D"width: 192.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 174.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 364.0px;">
</colgroup>
<tbody>
<tr>
<th data-highlight-colour=3D"#f5f5f5" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p><strong>Field Name</strong></p></th>
<th data-highlight-colour=3D"#f5f5f5" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p><strong>Type</strong></p></th>
<th data-highlight-colour=3D"#f5f5f5" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p><strong>Validation &amp; Requirements</strong></p></th>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>First Name*</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Text</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Only letters &amp; spaces; no special characters; trim spaces; n=
o repeated spaces</strong></p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Last Name*</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Text</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Same as First Name</strong></p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Designation*</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Text</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Same validations as Name</strong></p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Email ID*</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Email</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Valid format; no spaces; no consecutive dots; allowed characters=
: letters, numbers, ., -, _</strong></p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Company Name</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Text</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Optional</strong></p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Phone Number*</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Numeric</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Must be 10 digits</strong></p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<ul>
<li>
<p>If the user is already registered, a link =E2=80=9CAlready Registered? L=
og in Now=E2=80=9D is displayed to redirect them to the login page.</p></li=
>
<li>
<p><strong>Verification Flow:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Upon clicking Register, a verification email is sent to the provided ema=
il address.</p></li>
<li>
<p>The user sees a confirmation screen prompting them to check their email =
(Image 7).</p></li>
<li>
<p>The screen includes:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Message: =E2=80=9CCheck Your Mail!=E2=80=9D</p></li>
<li>
<p>Option to Change Email Address</p></li>
<li>
<p>Option to Resend Link</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p>The user clicks the verification link, sets and confirms their password,=
 and gains access to the portal.</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-4.Trigger:.1"><strong>4. Trigger:</strong></h3>
<p><strong>Manual initiation by the user (one-time action)</strong></p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-5.Pre-Condition:.1"><strong>5. Pre-Condition:</stron=
g></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Open access: Any individual with a venue can register from the p=
ortal.</strong></p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-6.Post-Condition:.1"><strong>6. Post-Condition:</str=
ong></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Venue Owner=E2=80=99s details are stored in the system.</p></li>
<li>
<p>A verification email is sent to the registered email address.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Upon clicking the verification link and setting a password, the user gai=
ns access to the portal.</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-7.BusinessRules:.1"><strong>7. Business Rules:</stro=
ng></h3>
<ol start=3D"1">
<li>
<p>Any individual who owns a venue can register as a Venue Owner.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Email verification is mandatory before accessing the portal.</p></li>
<li>
<p>If already registered, the user is redirected to the login page.</p></li=
>
</ol>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-8.Integration:.1"><strong>8. Integration:</strong></=
h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>SSO (Single Sign-On) for secure authentication and access control</p></l=
i>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-9.Screens:.1"><strong>9. Screens:</strong></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Home Page: =E2=80=9CList your offerings=E2=80=9D button</p></li>
<li>
<p>Registration Page: Form with all required fields and validations</p></li=
>
<li>
<p>Email Verification Screen: Confirmation message with options to change e=
mail or resend link</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Referenced: Image 6 and Image 7</strong></p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper c=
