lass=3D"expand-control-image" src=3D"f21dae11798d2af9ea1168a5798afeb45451aa=
fce182619f3dbe43f2e8b53628" width=3D"16" height=3D"16"></span><span class=
=3D"expand-control-text">2 (a). Venue Listing Page</span>
</div>
<div id=3D"expander-content-853563895" class=3D"expand-content">
<p></p>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-1.Interface:.5"><strong>1. Interface:</strong></h3>
<p><strong>Venue Listing Page</strong></p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-2.Role:.4"><strong>2. Role:</strong></h3>
<p><strong>Venue Owner</strong></p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-3.Description:.4"><strong>3. Description:</strong></=
h3>
<p>The <strong>Venue Listing Page</strong> provides Venue Owners with a com=
plete list of venues they have created or are managing. Venue Owners can <s=
trong>view, edit, disable, or delete</strong> their venues. This screen als=
o includes filtering, searching, and export functionalities to help Venue O=
wners manage their venue assets efficiently.</p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-4.AccessPoint:.2"><strong>4. Access Point:</strong><=
/h3>
<p>Sidebar =E2=86=92 <strong>Venue Management =E2=86=92 Venues</strong></p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-5.FunctionalOverview:.2"><strong>5. Functional Overv=
iew:</strong></h3>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"da5eca96-d9f0-4ab5-8f47-d6b=
877cfefe3" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<colgroup>
<col style=3D"width: 198.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 532.0px;">
</colgroup>
<tbody>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Feature</p></th>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Description</p></th>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Tabs</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Filters: <strong>All</strong>, <strong>Active</strong>, <strong>Inactive=
</strong> venues</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Search</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Search by <strong>Venue Name</strong>, <strong>Venue Code</strong>, or <=
strong>District Code</strong></p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Filters Button</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Advanced filtering (resource type, status, managers)</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Export</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Downloads the visible venues list (CSV/Excel)</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>+ Add Venue Button</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Redirects to venue registration form</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Pagination</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>=E2=80=9CShow More=E2=80=9D and arrow-based pagination controls</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Table View</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Displays all venues created by the Venue Owner</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Actions</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Edit</strong>, <strong>View</strong>, <strong>Disable</strong>, =
<strong>Delete</strong> buttons per venue</p></li>
</ul></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-6.TableColumns:.2"><strong>6. Table Columns:</strong=
></h3>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"68bdbb92-f899-4e8d-b970-eaa=
267c6a2ff" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<colgroup>
<col style=3D"width: 199.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 531.0px;">
</colgroup>
<tbody>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Column</p></th>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Description</p></th>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Venue Code</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Unique venue ID</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>District Code</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Unique district identifier</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Location</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>City and State</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Venue Name</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Full name of the venue</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Resource Type</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Tags showing resources available (e.g., Computer Labs, Classrooms)</p></=
td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Venue Manager</p></td>
