<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-7.ActionsAvailabletoVenueOwner:"><strong>7. Actions =
Available to Venue Owner:</strong></h3>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"f3dc421c-b862-438d-b9f8-eca=
1044bad19" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<colgroup>
<col style=3D"width: 304.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 426.0px;">
</colgroup>
<tbody>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Action</p></th>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Description</p></th>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Edit (Pencil Icon)</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Opens the venue registration form in edit mode</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>View (Eye Icon)</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Opens a read-only view of the venue</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Disable (Strikethrough Circle Icon)</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Temporarily marks the venue as inactive (requires confirmation)</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Delete (Trash Icon)</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Permanently deletes the venue (with confirmation popup)</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-8.BusinessRules:.1"><strong>8. Business Rules:</stro=
ng></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Venue Owners can <strong>only manage</strong> the venues they have creat=
ed or are assigned to.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Disabling a venue will <strong>temporarily hide</strong> it from the por=
tal and block bookings.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Deletion requires confirmation and <strong>removes venue permanently</st=
rong> if no bookings/projects are active.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Editing is allowed only if the venue is not linked to an <strong>ongoing=
 project</strong> or <strong>booked schedule</strong>.</p></li>
<li>
<p>At least one resource type is required for a valid venue.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Venue Managers listed should be from the approved user pool.</p></li>
<li>
<p>A venue <strong>cannot be deleted</strong> if it is in a <strong>Booked<=
/strong> or <strong>Mapped</strong> state.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Export reflects currently visible/filtered data only.</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-9.TriggerPoints:.1"><strong>9. Trigger Points:</stro=
ng></h3>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"e71c4783-2993-4a0e-816d-59b=
5ce5bbbb6" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<colgroup>
<col style=3D"width: 161.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 569.0px;">
</colgroup>
<tbody>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Trigger</p></th>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Outcome</p></th>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Click =E2=80=9CEdit=E2=80=9D</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Redirects to venue form with pre-filled details</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Click =E2=80=9CView=E2=80=9D</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Opens read-only popup with all venue data</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Click =E2=80=9CDisable=E2=80=9D</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Marks venue as inactive (confirmation required)</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Click =E2=80=9CDelete=E2=80=9D</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Triggers deletion process (if no active linkage exists)</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Filter/Search</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Updates venue list in real-time</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Export</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Downloads filtered data to file</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-10.Pre-Conditions:.1"><strong>10. Pre-Conditions:</s=
trong></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>User must be logged in as <strong>Venue Owner</strong></p></li>
<li>
<p>Venues must have been created by the logged-in user or assigned to them<=
/p></li>
<li>
<p>All venue actions are scoped to the user's permissions and mappings</p><=
/li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-11.Post-Conditions:.1"><strong>11. Post-Conditions:<=
/strong></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Status updates or deletions are reflected in the venue system</p></li>
<li>
<p>If audit logging is enabled, all actions (edit/view/delete/disable) are =
recorded</p></li>
<li>
<p>Exported file matches the current view state</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
