<div id=3D"expander-content-783486984" class=3D"expand-content">
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-1.Interface:.6"><strong>1. Interface:</strong></h3>
<p>Venue Details Page (Multi-step Form)</p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-2.Role:.5"><strong>2. Role:</strong></h3>
<p>Venue Owner</p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-3.Description:.5"><strong>3. Description:</strong></=
h3>
<p>This functionality enables the <strong>Venue Owner</strong> to onboard a=
 new venue or update an existing one by entering comprehensive details acro=
ss five structured steps. Each step captures specific aspects of the venue =
including basic information, infrastructure, safety, power backup, and reso=
urce availability. The process ensures that venues are accurately profiled =
for project mapping and booking purposes.</p>
<h4 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-FunctionalRequirements:.1"><strong>Functional Requir=
ements:</strong></h4>
<hr>
<h4 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-Step1:VenueDetails"><strong>Step 1: Venue Details</s=
trong></h4>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Basic Information:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Venue Code <em>(Auto-generated)</em></p></li>
<li>
<p>Venue Name*</p></li>
<li>
<p>Venue Type* (Dropdown: Institute, College, Private Center, School, Train=
ing Center)</p></li>
<li>
<p>Venue Owner Contact* (View-only)</p></li>
<li>
<p>Alternate Contact (View-only)</p></li>
<li>
<p>Venue Image* (Main gate image required; formats: PNG, JPG, JPEG, SVG, We=
bP; max 10MB)</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Address Details:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Country*, State*, City*, Taluka, Village* (Dropdowns via Government MDM =
API)</p></li>
<li>
<p>Pin-code*, Address Line 1*, Address Line 2, Landmark*</p></li>
<li>
<p>Google Map Link*, Latitude &amp; Longitude* (Auto-generated)</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Transport Connectivity:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Nearest Bus Stand*, Distance*</p></li>
<li>
<p>Nearest Railway Station*, Distance*</p></li>
<li>
<p>Nearest Airport, Distance*</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Documents Upload:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Email Agreement/Confirmation Letter*</p></li>
<li>
<p>PAN Card Number* and Copy*</p></li>
<li>
<p>GST Number and Certificate Copy</p></li>
<li>
<p>Venue Establishment Letter</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p><em>Resource Type:</em>*</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Dropdown: Computer Labs, Schools (Multi-select)</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Navigation Buttons:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Next, Back, Cancel</p></li>
<li>
<p>Auto-save expected at every step</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h4 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-Step2:InfrastructureDetails"><strong>Step 2: Infrast=
ructure Details</strong></h4>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Venue Identification:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Building/Community Name</p></li>
<li>
<p>Registration Email</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Images Upload:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Building Exterior, Reception Desk, Manager=E2=80=99s Cabin, Waiting Area=
</p></li>
<li>
<p>Restroom, Drinking Water Point, Locker Room, Special Needs Washroom, Uni=
sex Restroom</p></li>
<li>
<p>Parking: Lot, Basement, Bike</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Facility Availability:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Restroom, Drinking Water, Waiting Area, CCTV</p></li>
<li>
<p>Separate Entry &amp; Exit Gate</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Safety Risk Declarations:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Threat to personal/public safety</p></li>
<li>
<p>Hazardous material storage</p></li>
<li>
<p>Past incidents (last 3 years)</p></li>
<li>
<p>Specific threat zones</p></li>
<li>
<p>Upload Incident Reports</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h4 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-Step3:SafetyDetails"><strong>Step 3: Safety Details<=
/strong></h4>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Safety Equipment:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>First Aid Kit Available?* (Yes/No + Image Upload)</p></li>
<li>
<p>Fire Extinguishers on Each Floor?* (Yes/No + Image Upload)</p></li>
<li>
<p>Accessibility of Fire Extinguishers?* (Yes/No)</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Fire Safety Records:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Date of Last Clearance</p></li>
<li>
<p>Date of Last Refill</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Emergency Preparedness:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Assembly Area Available? (Yes/No)</p></li>
<li>
<p>Emergency Exit Signage? (Yes/No)</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Insurance Coverage:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Risk of asset loss, third-party accidents, etc. (Yes/No)</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h4 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-Step4:PowerBackupDetails"><strong>Step 4: Power Back=
up Details</strong></h4>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Genset Details:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Availability?* (Yes/No)</p></li>
<li>
<p>Type (e.g., Auto Switch-Over)</p></li>
<li>
<p>DG Capacity (KVA), Fuel Consumption per Hour</p></li>
<li>
<p>DG Service Date</p></li>
<li>
<p>Genset Image Upload (JPG, JPEG, PNG, PDF; max 1MB)</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p><strong>UPS Details:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Availability?* (Yes/No)</p></li>
<li>
<p>UPS Capacity (KVA), Backup Time (Minutes)</p></li>
<li>
<p>UPS Image Upload (same format and size)</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h4 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-Step5:ResourceDetails"><strong>Step 5: Resource Deta=
ils</strong></h4>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Resource Sections:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Labs and Classrooms</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Lab Details (per lab):</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Preliminary Details</p></li>
<li>
<p>Surveillance Details</p></li>
<li>
<p>Network Details</p></li>
<li>
<p>Computer Details</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Navigation Buttons:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Discard, Save as Draft, Next</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-4.Trigger:.2"><strong>4. Trigger:</strong></h3>
<p>Initiated by Venue Owner during venue onboarding or update</p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-5.Pre-Condition:.2"><strong>5. Pre-Condition:</stron=
g></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Venue Owner must be registered and logged in via SSO</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-6.Post-Condition:.2"><strong>6. Post-Condition:</str=
ong></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>A new venue is added or existing venue details are updated in the system=
</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-7.BusinessRules:.2"><strong>7. Business Rules:</stro=
ng></h3>
<ol start=3D"1">
<li>
<p>Only <strong>Venue Owners</strong> can register/add/edit venue and its d=
etails</p></li>
<li>
<p>Venue Owners can authorize <strong>Venue Managers</strong> to perform th=
ese actions</p></li>
</ol>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-8.Integration:.2"><strong>8. Integration:</strong></=
h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Government MDM</strong>: For location master data (Country, Stat=
e, City, etc.)</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>SSO</strong>: For secure login and role-based access</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
