<div id=3D"expander-content-28987124" class=3D"expand-content">
<p></p>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-1.Interface:.7"><strong>1. Interface:</strong></h3>
<p><strong>Venue Availability Page</strong></p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-2.Role:.6"><strong>2. Role:</strong></h3>
<p><strong>Venue Owner</strong><br>
(Can <strong>add</strong>, <strong>edit</strong>, and <strong>view</strong>=
 venue availability time slots and date ranges for venues assigned to them.=
)</p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-3.Description:.6"><strong>3. Description:</strong></=
h3>
<p>The <strong>Venue Availability</strong> screen allows the <strong>Venue =
Owner</strong> to configure and manage the <strong>time slot availability</=
strong> and <strong>date ranges</strong> for their assigned venues. This is=
 a critical interface for ensuring the venue is ready for exam scheduling a=
nd resource planning.</p>
<p>Venue Owners can:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>View and manage a list of all their venues</p></li>
<li>
<p>Add time slots (e.g., available hours in a day)</p></li>
<li>
<p>Add valid date ranges (e.g., from 01/07/2025 to 10/07/2025)</p></li>
<li>
<p>Edit previously configured slot and date details</p></li>
<li>
<p>Mark the venue status as =E2=80=9CConfigured=E2=80=9D upon successful se=
tup</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-4.AccessPoint:.3"><strong>4. Access Point:</strong><=
/h3>
<p>Main Sidebar =E2=86=92 <strong>Venue Management</strong> =E2=86=92 <stro=
ng>Venue Availability</strong></p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-5.FunctionalOverview:.3"><strong>5. Functional Overv=
iew:</strong></h3>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"acdca4da-d828-49f9-8d0d-ccd=
d9004530d" class=3D"confluenceTable">
