<p>Tabs</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Toggle between <strong>All</strong>, <strong>Pending</strong>, or <stron=
g>Configured</strong> venues</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Search Bar</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Search by <strong>Venue Code</strong> or <strong>District Code</strong><=
/p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Filters Button</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Opens additional filters (e.g., by status, location, district)</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Table Display</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Lists all venues mapped to the Venue Owner</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Add/Edit Slots</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Launches modal to add or update time slot configurations</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
