<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Launches popup to add or update valid date ranges</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Status Toggle</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Reflects current configuration status: Pending or Configured</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Pagination</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Standard pagination to navigate venue list</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-6.TableColumns:.3"><strong>6. Table Columns:</strong=
></h3>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"79cf7e5c-0cec-4f53-9b6f-026=
f7d69cccc" class=3D"confluenceTable">
