<p>Displays if venue is <strong>Pending</strong> or <strong>Configured</str=
ong></p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Actions</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Shows either =E2=80=9CAdd=E2=80=9D or =E2=80=9CEdit=E2=80=9D options dep=
ending on current configuration</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-7.UserActions:.1"><strong>7. User Actions:</strong><=
/h3>
<h4 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-Add/EditTimeSlots:"><strong>Add/Edit Time Slots:</st=
rong></h4>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Opens a <strong>modal</strong> allowing:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Adding new time slots (e.g., 9:00 - 18:00)</p></li>
<li>
<p>Updating existing time slots</p></li>
<li>
<p>Configuring resource details (e.g., lab availability, computers, buffer =
%)</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<h4 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-Add/EditDateRanges:"><strong>Add/Edit Date Ranges:</=
strong></h4>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Opens a <strong>popup</strong> to:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Add valid dates when the venue is available</p></li>
<li>
<p>Remove or adjust previously configured date ranges</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<h4 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-SaveConfiguration:"><strong>Save Configuration:</str=
ong></h4>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Venue Owner can save changes after slot and date range configuration</p>=
</li>
<li>
<p>Upon saving, the venue=E2=80=99s <strong>status</strong> updates to <str=
ong>Configured</strong></p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-8.BusinessRules:.2"><strong>8. Business Rules:</stro=
ng></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Venue Owners can only configure venues mapped to them</p></li>
<li>
<p>Both <strong>time slots</strong> and <strong>date ranges</strong> are ma=
ndatory for venue to be marked as Configured</p></li>
<li>
<p>A venue remains in <strong>Pending</strong> status until both configurat=
ions are completed</p></li>
<li>
<p>Validation checks must ensure:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>No overlapping date ranges</p></li>
<li>
<p>Time slots fall within logical day time (e.g., 6:00 AM =E2=80=93 10:00 P=
M)</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p>Multiple configurations allowed, but only one "active" period at a time<=
/p></li>
<li>
<p>System must auto-log modification metadata (timestamp, user)</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-9.TriggerPoints:.2"><strong>9. Trigger Points:</stro=
ng></h3>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"1573fcda-d18b-4420-a3c5-660=
c8d0edcc0" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<colgroup>
<col style=3D"width: 196.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 534.0px;">
</colgroup>
<tbody>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Trigger</p></th>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Outcome</p></th>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Click <strong>Add/Edit Slot</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Opens modal to configure daily time slots</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Click <strong>Add/Edit Date</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Opens popup to configure venue availability dates</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Save Time Slots</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Updates time range settings and stores in database</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Save Dates</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Updates date range settings and stores in database</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Complete Both</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Venue status switches from <strong>Pending</strong> =E2=86=92 <strong>Co=
nfigured</strong></p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Edit Existing</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Allows modifying previous configurations</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-10.Pre-Conditions:.2"><strong>10. Pre-Conditions:</s=
trong></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Venue Owner is logged in with valid credentials</p></li>
<li>
<p>At least one venue is mapped to their user profile</p></li>
<li>
<p>Configuration access is within the active window period (if applicable)<=
/p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-11.Post-Conditions:.2"><strong>11. Post-Conditions:<=
/strong></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Venue data is updated in real-time in the system</p></li>
<li>
<p>Venue marked as <strong>Configured</strong> becomes visible as such to P=
roject Heads and Admins</p></li>
<li>
<p>Historical changes (audit log) are maintained for each venue</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-12.IntegrationPoints:.1"><strong>12. Integration Poi=
nts:</strong></h3>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"214986f0-5e24-4bd3-8dd7-d20=
5189db002" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>System</p></th>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Purpose</p></th>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Venue Management System</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Fetch venue details, update configurations</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Role-Based Access (RBAC)</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Restrict access to mapped venues</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Audit Trail Service</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Log all changes with timestamps and user IDs</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<hr>
