<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-14.AvailabilityConfigurationDetails(PerVenue):"><str=
ong>14. Availability Configuration Details (Per Venue):</strong></h3>
<p>When a Venue Owner clicks to configure availability for a specific venue=
, the following detailed configuration options are presented:</p>
<h4 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-a.VenueInformation:"><strong>a. Venue Information:</=
strong></h4>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Venue Name: Displayed at top (e.g., Government Polytechnic, Sakoli)</p><=
/li>
<li>
<p>Location: City and District (e.g., Bhandara, Maharashtra)</p></li>
<li>
<p>Venue Code: Unique identifier (e.g., V001)</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h4 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-b.ConfigurationSegments:"><strong>b. Configuration S=
egments:</strong></h4>
<p>Each configuration section allows the Venue Owner to define time-based a=
nd resource-based availability.</p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"cfdf2cc7-dc7f-475c-bf89-b64=
336fbd758" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Segment</p></th>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Description</p></th>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Date Range Picker</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Select a single date or a date range (mandatory)</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Slot Type</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Choose between <strong>Full Day</strong> or <strong>Time Slot</strong></=
p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Start Time / End Time</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Enabled only when Time Slot is selected; allows choosing specific hours =
(in HH:MM format)</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Full Venue Toggle</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Marks whether the full venue is available for use</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Self Blocked Toggle</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Marks the venue as unavailable due to internal reasons (maintenance, exa=
ms, etc.)</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Set Repetition</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Allows repetition of configuration across selected weekdays (Sun to Sat =
checkboxes)</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<hr>
<h4 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-c.Lab/Room-LevelConfigurationTable:"><strong>c. Lab/=
Room-Level Configuration Table:</strong></h4>
<p>This section provides granular configuration at the <strong>Computer Lab=
</strong> or <strong>Classroom</strong> level:</p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"5b98e473-46cf-40c7-acdc-2bc=
37374a500" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Field</p></th>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Description</p></th>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Lab Name</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Identifier for the lab (e.g., Lab 1)</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Computers Available</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Total functional computers in the lab</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Computers Offered</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Number of computers being offered for exam scheduling</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Buffers Available</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Extra available computers that are not offered by default</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Buffers Offered</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>How many buffer machines are being made available along with the main on=
es</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Total Computers Offered</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Sum of Computers Offered + Buffers Offered</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Checkbox (per lab)</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Enables or disables that lab for the current date/time slot configuratio=
n</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<p>At the bottom of the table, the system <strong>auto-calculates totals</s=
trong> for:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Total Computers Available</p></li>
<li>
<p>Total Computers Offered</p></li>
<li>
<p>Buffers Available and Offered</p></li>
<li>
<p>Final Total Computers Offered (including buffers)</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h4 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-d.MultipleConfigurationsSupport:"><strong>d. Multipl=
e Configurations Support:</strong></h4>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Venue Owners can define <strong>multiple blocks of date/time configurati=
ons</strong> within the same screen by clicking <code>+Date Slot</code>.</p=
></li>
<li>
<p>Each configuration block has its own lab-level configuration, toggles, a=
nd date range.</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h4 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-e.SaveAction:"><strong>e. Save Action:</strong></h4>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Once configuration(s) are defined, clicking <strong>Save</strong> commit=
s the entire availability setup for that venue.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Configuration will be stored, reflected in the Venue Availability table,=
 and status will update to <strong>Configured</strong>.</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-15.Validation&amp;BusinessLogic(Extended):"><strong>=
15. Validation &amp; Business Logic (Extended):</strong></h3>
<p>In addition to the earlier Business Rules:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Total =E2=80=9CComputers Offered=E2=80=9D cannot exceed =E2=80=9CCompute=
rs Available=E2=80=9D per lab</p></li>
<li>
<p>=E2=80=9CBuffers Offered=E2=80=9D must be =E2=89=A4 =E2=80=9CBuffers Ava=
ilable=E2=80=9D</p></li>
<li>
<p>At least one lab must be selected in a configuration</p></li>
<li>
<p>For Time Slots: <code>Start Time</code> must be earlier than <code>End T=
ime</code></p></li>
<li>
<p>"Full Venue" and "Self Blocked" are mutually exclusive (cannot be enable=
d together)</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
