<span class=3D"expand-control-icon"><img style=3D"vertical-align:middle;" c=
lass=3D"expand-control-image" src=3D"f21dae11798d2af9ea1168a5798afeb45451aa=
fce182619f3dbe43f2e8b53628" width=3D"16" height=3D"16"></span><span class=
=3D"expand-control-text">3. Register Venue Manager / Agent / Aggregator</sp=
an>
</div>
<div id=3D"expander-content-1459369688" class=3D"expand-content">
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-1.Interface:.8"><strong>1. Interface:</strong></h3>
<p>Venue Details Page</p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-2.Role:.7"><strong>2. Role:</strong></h3>
<p>Venue Owner</p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-3.Description:.7"><strong>3. Description:</strong></=
h3>
<p>This functionality allows the <strong>Venue Owner</strong> to register o=
r assign a <strong>Venue Manager</strong>, <strong>Agent</strong>, or <stro=
ng>Aggregator</strong> to manage one or more venues on their behalf. The Ve=
nue Owner can choose to assign an existing user or invite a new one via ema=
il. Once invited, the user must verify their email to gain access to the po=
rtal. The Venue Owner can configure access permissions for each assigned us=
er, either by default or through granular module-level controls.</p>
<h4 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-FunctionalRequirements:.2"><strong>Functional Requir=
ements:</strong></h4>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>User Selection:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Choose between <strong>Existing</strong> or <strong>New</strong> Venue M=
anager</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Existing: Dropdown list of registered users</p></li>
<li>
<p>New: Enter email ID to invite</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Assignment Capabilities:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Add one or more Venue Managers</p></li>
<li>
<p>Assign one Venue Manager to multiple venues</p></li>
<li>
<p>Skip Venue Manager assignment if not required</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Access Configuration:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>By default, all functionality access is granted</p></li>
<li>
<p>Venue Owner can deselect modules to restrict access</p></li>
<li>
<p>Permissions include:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Dashboard: View, Download Reports</p></li>
<li>
<p>Venue Management: View, Add, Edit, Deactivate, Download</p></li>
<li>
<p>Services: Add, Edit, Deactivate, Download</p></li>
<li>
<p>Mapping &amp; Availability: Add Project/General Availability</p></li>
<li>
<p>Bookings: Upload/View Contract, Reject/Cancel Booking</p></li>
<li>
<p>Pricing: Edit</p></li>
<li>
<p>Reports: Download</p></li>
<li>
<p>Payments: Follow-up Mails</p></li>
<li>
<p>Cancellation &amp; Refund: Initiate Refund</p></li>
<li>
<p>Attendance Management: View Only</p></li>
<li>
<p>Profile: Update Email</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Actions Available:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Add More: Add additional Venue Managers</p></li>
<li>
<p>Remove: Delete assigned Venue Manager</p></li>
<li>
<p>Skip: Bypass this step</p></li>
<li>
<p>Back, Discard</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-4.Trigger:.3"><strong>4. Trigger:</strong></h3>
<p>Initiated by Venue Owner during venue setup or management</p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-5.Pre-Condition:.3"><strong>5. Pre-Condition:</stron=
g></h3>
<ol start=3D"1">
<li>
<p>Venue Owner must be registered</p></li>
<li>
<p>Authorization permissions must be defined in <strong>RBAC</strong></p></=
li>
</ol>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-6.Post-Condition:.3"><strong>6. Post-Condition:</str=
ong></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Venue Manager / Agent / Aggregator receives an email invitation</p></li>
<li>
<p>Upon verification, they gain access to the portal with assigned permissi=
ons</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-7.BusinessRules:.3"><strong>7. Business Rules:</stro=
ng></h3>
<ol start=3D"1">
<li>
<p>Only <strong>Venue Owners</strong> can register Venue Managers / Agents =
/ Aggregators</p></li>
<li>
<p>Access control must be managed via <strong>RBAC</strong></p></li>
<li>
<p>Email verification is mandatory for new users</p></li>
</ol>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-8.Integration:.3"><strong>8. Integration:</strong></=
h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>RBAC (Role-Based Access Control)</strong>: For managing module-l=
evel permissions</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-9.Screens:.3"><strong>9. Screens:</strong></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Venue Manager Assignment and Access Configuration Interface</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Referenced: <strong>Image 13</strong></p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper c=
onfluence-embedded-manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image ima=
