<div id=3D"expander-control-702842767" class=3D"expand-control">
<span class=3D"expand-control-icon"><img style=3D"vertical-align:middle;" c=
lass=3D"expand-control-image" src=3D"f21dae11798d2af9ea1168a5798afeb45451aa=
fce182619f3dbe43f2e8b53628" width=3D"16" height=3D"16"></span><span class=
=3D"expand-control-text">4. Authorization of Venue Manager / Agent / Aggreg=
ator</span>
</div>
<div id=3D"expander-content-702842767" class=3D"expand-content">
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-1.Interface:.9"><strong>1. Interface:</strong></h3>
<p>Authorization Section on Venue Details Page</p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-2.Role:.8"><strong>2. Role:</strong></h3>
<p>Venue Owner</p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-3.Description:.8"><strong>3. Description:</strong></=
h3>
<p>This functionality allows the <strong>Venue Owner</strong> to authorize =
a <strong>Venue Manager</strong>, <strong>Agent</strong>, or <strong>Aggreg=
ator</strong> who has self-registered and requested access to manage a venu=
e. The Venue Owner can view all authorization requests, approve or reject t=
hem, and configure access permissions for approved users. This ensures that=
 only verified and authorized personnel can manage venue operations.</p>
<h4 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-FunctionalRequirements:.3"><strong>Functional Requir=
ements:</strong></h4>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Authorization Listing Page:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Displays all requests with the following parameters:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>User Name</p></li>
<li>
<p>Role</p></li>
<li>
<p>Email</p></li>
<li>
<p>Contact</p></li>
<li>
<p>Location</p></li>
<li>
<p>Status (Pending, Approved, Rejected)</p></li>
<li>
<p>Actions (Approve, Reject, Manage)</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Status Filters:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>All</p></li>
<li>
<p>Pending</p></li>
<li>
<p>Approved</p></li>
<li>
<p>Rejected</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Action Buttons:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Approve</strong>:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Opens access configuration screen</p></li>
<li>
<p>Venue Owner defines module-level access</p></li>
<li>
<p>User is added to User Management listing</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Reject</strong>:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Confirmation popup: =E2=80=9CAre you sure you want to reject this reques=
t?=E2=80=9D</p></li>
<li>
<p>Venue Manager can resend the request</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Manage</strong>:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Modify access permissions for already approved users</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Search &amp; Bulk Actions:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Search by Name, Email, Contact</p></li>
<li>
<p>Bulk Approve / Reject options</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-4.Trigger:.4"><strong>4. Trigger:</strong></h3>
<p>Triggered when a Venue Manager / Agent / Aggregator requests authorizati=
on for a venue</p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-5.Pre-Condition:.4"><strong>5. Pre-Condition:</stron=
g></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Venue Manager / Agent / Aggregator must have the <strong>Venue ID</stron=
g> for which they are requesting authorization</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-6.Post-Condition:.4"><strong>6. Post-Condition:</str=
ong></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Venue Owner receives the request in the dashboard</p></li>
<li>
<p>Upon approval, the user is granted access and listed in User Management<=
/p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-7.BusinessRules:.4"><strong>7. Business Rules:</stro=
ng></h3>
<ol start=3D"1">
<li>
<p>Venue Owner must share the <strong>Venue ID</strong> with the requesting=
 user</p></li>
<li>
<p>Only Venue Owners can approve or reject authorization requests</p></li>
<li>
<p>Venue Manager can resend the request if rejected</p></li>
</ol>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-8.Integration:.4"><strong>8. Integration:</strong></=
h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>RBAC (Role-Based Access Control)</strong>: For managing access p=
ermissions</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-9.Screens:.4"><strong>9. Screens:</strong></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Authorization Listing and Access Management Interface</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Referenced: <strong>Image 14</strong></p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper c=
onfluence-embedded-manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image ima=
