<span class=3D"expand-control-icon"><img style=3D"vertical-align:middle;" c=
lass=3D"expand-control-image" src=3D"f21dae11798d2af9ea1168a5798afeb45451aa=
fce182619f3dbe43f2e8b53628" width=3D"16" height=3D"16"></span><span class=
=3D"expand-control-text">5. Calendar - Venue Availability by Day/Days and S=
hift</span>
</div>
<div id=3D"expander-content-1820864313" class=3D"expand-content">
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-1.Interface:.10"><strong>1. Interface:</strong></h3>
<p>Calendar View and Resource Availability Dashboard</p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-2.Role:.9"><strong>2. Role:</strong></h3>
<p>Venue Owner</p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-3.Description:.9"><strong>3. Description:</strong></=
h3>
<p>This functionality enables the <strong>Venue Owner</strong> to view and =
manage the availability of their venues (labs, classrooms, etc.) on a <stro=
ng>day-wise</strong> and <strong>shift-wise</strong> basis. The calendar in=
terface provides a color-coded visual representation of booking statuses, h=
elping the Venue Owner quickly assess which resources are available, booked=
, or under discussion.</p>
<h4 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-FunctionalRequirements:.4"><strong>Functional Requir=
ements:</strong></h4>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Calendar View:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Displays availability status for each day of the month</p></li>
<li>
<p>Days of the week: Mon to Sun</p></li>
<li>
<p>Status indicators:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Green</strong>: Available</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Red</strong>: Booked by Others</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Orange</strong>: Booked by Self</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Purple</strong>: In Discussion</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Detailed Resource View:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>For each selected date, display:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Resource Type (Labs, Classrooms)</p></li>
<li>
<p>Resource Name (e.g., Lab 1, Classroom 2)</p></li>
<li>
<p>Slot-wise breakdown:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Slot 1: Start Time =E2=80=93 End Time</p></li>
<li>
<p>Slot 2: Start Time =E2=80=93 End Time</p></li>
<li>
<p>Slot 3: Start Time =E2=80=93 End Time</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p>Status per slot (color-coded)</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Filters:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Project Filter</strong>: Level 1, Project 1, Project 2, General<=
/p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Subproject Filter</strong>: SP1, SP2, SP3, General</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Time Index</strong>:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>All Day</p></li>
<li>
<p>Morning (08:00=E2=80=9312:00)</p></li>
<li>
<p>Afternoon (12:00=E2=80=9316:00)</p></li>
<li>
<p>Evening (16:00=E2=80=9320:00)</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Interactive Elements:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Click on any date to view detailed availability</p></li>
<li>
<p>=E2=80=9Ci=E2=80=9D button tooltip: =E2=80=9CYou can view availability u=
p to 1 month from the current date=E2=80=9D</p></li>
<li>
<p>OK button on resource cards</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Scenarios Supported:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Full Venue =E2=80=93 Full Day</strong>: Single status for all re=
sources</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Full Venue =E2=80=93 Time Slots</strong>: Single status across t=
ime slots</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Partial Venue =E2=80=93 Full Day</strong>: Mixed status across r=
esources</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Partial Venue =E2=80=93 Time Slots</strong>: Mixed status across=
 slots and resources</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-4.Trigger:.5"><strong>4. Trigger:</strong></h3>
<p>Accessed by Venue Owner from the calendar menu to monitor and manage ven=
ue availability</p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-5.Pre-Condition:.5"><strong>5. Pre-Condition:</stron=
g></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Venue must be onboarded and resources defined</p></li>
<li>
<p>Booking data must be available for the selected date range</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-6.Post-Condition:.5"><strong>6. Post-Condition:</str=
ong></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Venue Owner can view and interpret availability status</p></li>
<li>
<p>Can take informed decisions for booking, blocking, or responding to quot=
e requests</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-7.BusinessRules:.5"><strong>7. Business Rules:</stro=
ng></h3>
<ol start=3D"1">
<li>
<p>Availability status must be color-coded for clarity</p></li>
<li>
<p>Venue Owner can view availability for up to one month ahead</p></li>
<li>
<p>Booking status reflects real-time data including quote discussions</p></=
li>
</ol>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-8.Integration:.5"><strong>8. Integration:</strong></=
h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Internal Booking System</p></li>
<li>
<p>Project/Subproject Mapping</p></li>
<li>
<p>Resource Scheduling Engine</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-9.Screens:.5"><strong>9. Screens:</strong></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Calendar Interface with Filters and Status Indicators</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Referenced: <strong>Image 15</strong>, <strong>Image 16</strong>, <stron=
g>Image 17</strong></p></li>
</ul></li>
