fce182619f3dbe43f2e8b53628" width=3D"16" height=3D"16"></span><span class=
=3D"expand-control-text">6. Contract Terms &amp; Conditions Upload and Appr=
oval</span>
</div>
<div id=3D"expander-content-311704407" class=3D"expand-content">
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-1.Interface:.11"><strong>1. Interface:</strong></h3>
<p><strong>Venue Booking List =E2=86=92 Upload Contract Terms &amp; Conditi=
ons</strong></p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-2.Role:.10"><strong>2. Role:</strong></h3>
<p><strong>Venue Owner</strong></p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-3.Description:.10"><strong>3. Description:</strong><=
/h3>
<p>This functionality enables Venue Owners to upload contract terms and con=
ditions for client review and approval within the VBSA portal. It is part o=
f the booking management workflow and supports actions such as uploading, v=
iewing, and submitting contracts, along with managing booking statuses.</p>
<h4 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-AccessPoint:"><strong>Access Point:</strong></h4>
<ul>
<li>
<p>User navigates to the <strong>Booking Tab</strong> from the main menu.</=
p></li>
<li>
<p>Selects the <strong>Venues</strong> sub-tab.</p></li>
<li>
<p>System displays the <strong>Venue Booking List Page</strong>.</p></li>
</ul>
<h4 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-UploadFlow:"><strong>Upload Flow:</strong></h4>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Venue Owner clicks <strong>Upload</strong> or <strong>Reupload</strong> =
next to a booking record.</p></li>
<li>
<p>A form appears with:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Upload Document</strong> field (supports multiple formats: pdf, =
txt, xlsx, png, jpg, jpeg, svg, doc).</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Remarks (if any)</strong> field.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Submit</strong> button.</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<h4 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-Submission:"><strong>Submission:</strong></h4>
<ul>
<li>
<p>On clicking <strong>Submit</strong>, the document is forwarded to:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>The respective <strong>Client/Client Agent</strong></p></li>
<li>
<p>The <strong>Venue Manager</strong></p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<h4 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-ViewContract:"><strong>View Contract:</strong></h4>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Venue Owner can view and download the uploaded contract.</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-4.Trigger:.6"><strong>4. Trigger:</strong></h3>
<p>Manual initiation by Venue Owner per booking record or via bulk action.<=
/p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-5.Pre-Condition:.6"><strong>5. Pre-Condition:</stron=
g></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Booking request must exist in the system.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Venue Owner must be logged in and have access to the booking record.</p>=
</li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-6.Post-Condition:.6"><strong>6. Post-Condition:</str=
ong></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Contract document is stored and linked to the booking.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Notification sent to Client/Client Agent and Venue Manager.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Booking status updated accordingly.</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-7.BusinessRules:.6"><strong>7. Business Rules:</stro=
ng></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Upload allowed only for bookings in specific statuses (e.g., Quote Reque=
sted, Rejected by Client, Change Request).</p></li>
<li>
<p>Reupload allowed if a previous contract exists.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Remarks are optional but encouraged for clarity.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Confirmation pop-ups must appear for all actions.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Bulk actions must follow the same validation and flow.</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-8.Integration:.6"><strong>8. Integration:</strong></=
h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Document Management System (DMS) for file storage and retrieval.</p></li=
>
<li>
<p>Notification System for alerts to stakeholders.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Booking Status Engine for status updates and transitions.</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-9.Screens:.6"><strong>9. Screens:</strong></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Venue Booking List Page</strong>: Displays booking records with =
action buttons.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Upload Contract Form</strong>: Includes file upload, remarks, an=
d submit button (referenced: <strong>Image_2</strong>).</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>View Contract Modal/Page</strong>: Allows viewing and downloadin=
g of uploaded contracts.</p></li>
</ul><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper c=
onfluence-embedded-manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image ima=
ge-center" alt=3D"image (8).png" width=3D"468" loading=3D"lazy" src=3D"5a9e=
