<div id=3D"expander-control-820284596" class=3D"expand-control">
<span class=3D"expand-control-icon"><img style=3D"vertical-align:middle;" c=
lass=3D"expand-control-image" src=3D"f21dae11798d2af9ea1168a5798afeb45451aa=
fce182619f3dbe43f2e8b53628" width=3D"16" height=3D"16"></span><span class=
=3D"expand-control-text">7. Receives signed terms and contract from client<=
/span>
</div>
<div id=3D"expander-content-820284596" class=3D"expand-content">
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-1.Interface:.12"><strong>1. Interface:</strong></h3>
<p><strong>Venue Booking List =E2=86=92 Contract Status Update</strong></p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-2.Role:.11"><strong>2. Role:</strong></h3>
<p><strong>Venue Owner</strong></p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-3.Description:.11"><strong>3. Description:</strong><=
/h3>
<p>This functionality enables Venue Owners to receive and track signed cont=
ract documents submitted by clients. It ensures that the contract lifecycle=
 is complete and that the signed agreement is stored and accessible within =
the system.</p>
<h4 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-AccessPoint:.1"><strong>Access Point:</strong></h4>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Venue Owner navigates to the <strong>Booking Tab</strong> =E2=86=92 <str=
ong>Venues</strong> sub-tab.</p></li>
<li>
<p>System displays the <strong>Venue Booking List Page</strong> with update=
d status and actions.</p></li>
</ul>
<h4 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-ReceptionFlow:"><strong>Reception Flow:</strong></h4=
>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Once the client signs and submits the contract, the system:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Updates the booking status to <strong>"Confirmed"</strong>.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Notifies the Venue Owner via in-app notification and/or email.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Enables the <strong>View Contract</strong> action for the signed documen=
t.</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<h4 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-ContractAccess:"><strong>Contract Access:</strong></=
h4>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Venue Owner can:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>View the signed contract.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Download the document for offline reference.</p></li>
<li>
<p>See the timestamp of submission and client remarks (if any).</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-4.Trigger:.7"><strong>4. Trigger:</strong></h3>
<p>Client submits the signed contract via their portal interface.</p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-5.Pre-Condition:.7"><strong>5. Pre-Condition:</stron=
g></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Contract must have been uploaded by the Venue Owner.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Client must have access to the contract and the ability to sign and subm=
it it.</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-6.Post-Condition:.7"><strong>6. Post-Condition:</str=
ong></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Booking status is updated to <strong>Confirmed</strong>.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Signed contract is stored in the system.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Venue Owner is notified and can access the document.</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-7.BusinessRules:.7"><strong>7. Business Rules:</stro=
ng></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Only bookings with a submitted contract can receive a signed version.</p=
></li>
<li>
<p>Signed contracts are read-only for the Venue Owner.</p></li>
<li>
<p>System must log the date and time of client submission.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Status transition to <strong>Confirmed</strong> is automatic upon client=
 submission.</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-8.Integration:.7"><strong>8. Integration:</strong></=
h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Document Management System (DMS) for storing signed contracts.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Notification System for alerting Venue Owners.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Booking Status Engine for automatic status updates.</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-9.Screens:.7"><strong>9. Screens:</strong></h3>
<p><em>To be designed.</em></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Venue Booking List Page</strong>: Updated status and action butt=
ons.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Contract Viewer Modal/Page</strong>: Displays signed contract wi=
th metadata (submission date, client remarks).</p></li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
<div id=3D"expander-2100508877" class=3D"expand-container">
<div id=3D"expander-control-2100508877" class=3D"expand-control">
<span class=3D"expand-control-icon"><img style=3D"vertical-align:middle;" c=
lass=3D"expand-control-image" src=3D"f21dae11798d2af9ea1168a5798afeb45451aa=
fce182619f3dbe43f2e8b53628" width=3D"16" height=3D"16"></span><span class=
=3D"expand-control-text">8. Attends to booking change requests which may in=
clude using blocked seats jira ticket details</span>
</div>
<div id=3D"expander-content-2100508877" class=3D"expand-content">
<p><strong>Manage Client-Initiated Booking Change Requests Including Blocke=
d Seat Adjustments</strong><br><br><strong>1. Interface:</strong></p>
<p><strong>Venue Booking List =E2=86=92 Change Request Handling</strong></p=
>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-2.Role:.12"><strong>2. Role:</strong></h3>
<p><strong>Venue Owner</strong></p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-3.Description:.12"><strong>3. Description:</strong><=
/h3>
<p>This functionality allows Venue Owners to manage <strong>Change Requests=
</strong> initiated by clients. These requests may involve modifications to=
 booking details, including the use of previously blocked seats or resource=
s. The Venue Owner can review, accept, reject, or update the booking accord=
ingly.</p>
<h4 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-AccessPoint:.2"><strong>Access Point:</strong></h4>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Venue Owner navigates to the <strong>Booking Tab</strong> =E2=86=92 <str=
ong>Venues</strong> sub-tab.</p></li>
<li>
<p>System displays the <strong>Venue Booking List Page</strong>.</p></li>
<li>
<p>User selects the <strong>Change Request</strong> tab to view all relevan=
t bookings.</p></li>
</ul>
<h4 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-ChangeRequestFlow:"><strong>Change Request Flow:</st=
rong></h4>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Venue Owner clicks <strong>Details</strong> to view:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Venue Name, Client Name, Booking Date, Requested Date &amp; Slot</p></li=
>
<li>
<p>Linked Services (Manpower, Devices if applicable)</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p>Calendar view shows:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Requested/Confirmed slots</p></li>
<li>
<p>Overlapping requests</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p>Venue Owner can:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Accept the change (updates booking status)</p></li>
<li>
<p>Reject the change (booking reverts to <strong>Confirmed</strong> status)=
</p></li>
<li>
<p>Reupload updated contract if needed</p></li>
<li>
<p>Add remarks</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-4.Trigger:.8"><strong>4. Trigger:</strong></h3>
<p>Client initiates a change request for an existing booking.</p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-5.Pre-Condition:.8"><strong>5. Pre-Condition:</stron=
g></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Booking must be in a valid state (e.g., Confirmed or Contract Submitted)=
.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Client must have submitted a change request.</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-6.Post-Condition:.8"><strong>6. Post-Condition:</str=
ong></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Booking status updated based on Venue Owner=E2=80=99s action.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Notifications sent to Client and Venue Manager.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Updated contract (if any) stored in the system.</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-7.BusinessRules:.8"><strong>7. Business Rules:</stro=
ng></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Change Requests are only actionable before the event date.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Rejecting a Change Request reverts the booking to <strong>Confirmed</str=
ong> status.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Calendar must reflect updated availability and overlaps.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Remarks are optional but encouraged for audit trail.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Bulk actions (Accept/Reject/Upload) must follow same validations.</p></l=
i>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-8.Integration:.8"><strong>8. Integration:</strong></=
h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Calendar System for slot management and overlap detection.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Document Management System (DMS) for contract updates.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Notification System for alerts to stakeholders.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Booking Status Engine for transitions.</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-9.Screens:.8"><strong>9. Screens:</strong></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Venue Booking List Page</strong>: Tabs for filtering by status (=
Change Request highlighted).</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Details Modal/Page</strong>: Displays booking and service detail=
s.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Calendar View</strong>: Shows slot availability and overlaps.</p=
></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Upload Contract Form</strong>: For reuploading updated documents=
.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Action Toolbar</strong>: For bulk actions and filtering.</p></li=
>
</ul><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper c=
onfluence-embedded-manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image ima=
ge-center" alt=3D"image (13).jpg" width=3D"468" loading=3D"lazy" src=3D"ac2=
