<div id=3D"expander-control-551414325" class=3D"expand-control">
<span class=3D"expand-control-icon"><img style=3D"vertical-align:middle;" c=
lass=3D"expand-control-image" src=3D"f21dae11798d2af9ea1168a5798afeb45451aa=
fce182619f3dbe43f2e8b53628" width=3D"16" height=3D"16"></span><span class=
=3D"expand-control-text">9. Add and Manage Services with Pricing by Venue O=
wner</span>
</div>
<div id=3D"expander-content-551414325" class=3D"expand-content">
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-1.Interface:.13"><strong>1. Interface:</strong></h3>
<p><strong>Services Management =E2=86=92 Add/Edit Services</strong></p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-2.Role:.13"><strong>2. Role:</strong></h3>
<p><strong>Venue Owner</strong></p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-3.Description:.13"><strong>3. Description:</strong><=
/h3>
<p>This functionality enables Venue Owners to define and manage services th=
ey offer=E2=80=94such as invigilators, CCTC, Security guard, etc.=E2=80=94a=
long with associated details like pricing, availability, and venue linkage.=
 Services can be either venue-specific or independent (available across all=
 venues).</p>
<h4 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-AccessPoint:.3"><strong>Access Point:</strong></h4>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Venue Owner navigates to <strong>Services Management</strong> from the s=
idebar.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Clicks <strong>Add Service</strong> to open the service configuration fo=
rm.</p></li>
</ul>
<h4 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-ServiceEntryFlow:"><strong>Service Entry Flow:</stro=
ng></h4>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Select <strong>Service Type</strong> from predefined categories.</p></li=
>
<li>
<p>Enter:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Service Provider Name</strong></p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>PAN</strong> and <strong>GSTIN</strong></p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Service Location</strong>:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Country</strong>, <strong>State</strong>, and <strong>City</stro=
ng> dropdowns</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Short Description</strong> (max 100 words)</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Upload Images</strong> (up to 3, max 10MB each)</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p>Choose <strong>Nature of Service</strong>:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Venue Specific</strong>: Link to one or more venues via dropdown=
s or checkboxes.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Independent</strong>: Available across all venues (no venue link=
ing).</p></li>
<li>
<p>Both</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p>Define <strong>Service Availability</strong>:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Slot Type</strong>: Full Day or Time Slot</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Date Picker</strong>: Select availability dates</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Time Picker</strong>: For time slot-based services: Link the ser=
vice that Venue Owner is creating to already created and approved venues.</=
p></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p>Click <strong>Save</strong> to store the service.</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-4.Trigger:.9"><strong>4. Trigger:</strong></h3>
<p>Manual initiation by Venue Owner to add or update services.</p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-5.Pre-Condition:.9"><strong>5. Pre-Condition:</stron=
g></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Venue Owner must be registered and logged in.</p></li>
<li>
<p>At least one venue must be listed under the owner=E2=80=99s account (for=
 venue-specific services).</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-6.Post-Condition:.9"><strong>6. Post-Condition:</str=
ong></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Service is stored in the system and linked to selected venues (if applic=
able).</p></li>
<li>
<p>Service becomes available for booking or internal use based on availabil=
ity settings.</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-7.BusinessRules:.9"><strong>7. Business Rules:</stro=
ng></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>PAN and GSTIN must follow valid formats.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Description must not exceed 100 words.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Images must be within size and count limits.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Venue linking is mandatory for venue-specific services.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Availability settings must be defined before saving.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Independent services cannot be linked to specific venues.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Country, State, and City must be selected for service location.</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-8.Integration:.9"><strong>8. Integration:</strong></=
h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Document Storage</strong>: For service images.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Venue Management System</strong>: For linking services to venues=
.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Booking Engine</strong>: To reflect service availability.</p></l=
i>
<li>
<p><strong>Tax Validation API</strong>: Optional for PAN/GSTIN verification=
.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Location Services</strong>: For validating and storing geographi=
c data.</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-9.Screens:.9"><strong>9. Screens:</strong></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Add/Edit Service Form</strong>:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Fields for service details, location, tax info</p></li>
<li>
<p>Dropdowns for Country, State, City</p></li>
<li>
<p>Image upload section</p></li>
<li>
<p>Radio buttons for service nature</p></li>
<li>
<p>Venue linking dropdowns or checkboxes</p></li>
<li>
<p>Availability configuration (date/time slots)</p></li>
<li>
<p>Save button</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper c=
onfluence-embedded-manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image ima=
ge-center" alt=3D"image (12).png" width=3D"468" loading=3D"lazy" src=3D"1fa=
e5c54b3032eea14a9382090486d6dca6825852a80bd0b53a179214ac871cc" data-image-s=
rc=3D"https://hubblehoxtech.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/3887595=
54/image%20(12).png?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D1751531935585&amp;ca=
cheVersion=3D1&amp;api=3Dv2" data-height=3D"1231" data-width=3D"812" data-u=
nresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=3D"388530223" data-li=
nked-resource-version=3D"1" data-linked-resource-type=3D"attachment" data-l=
inked-resource-default-alias=3D"image (12).png" data-base-url=3D"https://hu=
bblehoxtech.atlassian.net/wiki" data-linked-resource-content-type=3D"image/=
png" data-linked-resource-container-id=3D"388759554" data-linked-resource-c=
ontainer-version=3D"26" data-media-id=3D"f2967eb1-f22f-4497-98f9-ed7f972e0b=
b2" data-media-type=3D"file" height=3D"709"></span>
</div>
</div>
<div id=3D"expander-1908273337" class=3D"expand-container">
<div id=3D"expander-control-1908273337" class=3D"expand-control">
<span class=3D"expand-control-icon"><img style=3D"vertical-align:middle;" c=
lass=3D"expand-control-image" src=3D"f21dae11798d2af9ea1168a5798afeb45451aa=
fce182619f3dbe43f2e8b53628" width=3D"16" height=3D"16"></span><span class=
=3D"expand-control-text">10. Add and Manage Manpower </span>
</div>
<div id=3D"expander-content-1908273337" class=3D"expand-content">
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-1.Interface:.14"><strong>1. Interface:</strong></h3>
<p><strong>Service Management &gt; Manpower Page</strong></p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-2.Role:.14"><strong>2. Role:</strong></h3>
<p><strong>Venue Owner</strong><br>
(<em>Can add, edit, and view manpower configurations for their assigned ven=
ues.</em>)</p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-3.Description:.14"><strong>3. Description:</strong><=
/h3>
<p>This screen allows Venue Owners to define, manage, and review the <stron=
g>manpower allocation</strong> across computer labs or classrooms for their=
 mapped venues. Venue Owners are responsible for updating the number of sta=
ff deployed per role to ensure smooth conduct of activities like exam setup=
, invigilation, technical support, etc.</p>
<p>They can configure manpower allocation <strong>per time slot</strong> an=
d <strong>date range</strong>, with the ability to set <strong>repeat patte=
rns</strong>, buffer counts, and total deployment.</p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-4.AccessPoint:.4"><strong>4. Access Point:</strong><=
/h3>
<p>Main Sidebar =E2=86=92 <strong>Service Management</strong> =E2=86=92 <st=
rong>Manpower</strong></p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-5.FunctionalOverview:.4"><strong>5. Functional Overv=
iew:</strong></h3>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"9c9f28bb-430a-460b-b65a-4de=
14ec8bc5b" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Feature</p></th>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Description</p></th>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Venue Details Panel</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Shows the venue name, location, district, and venue code</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Category Tabs</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Toggle between different infrastructure types (e.g., Computer Labs, Clas=
srooms)</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Date Range Input</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Select a single date or a date range to define manpower applicability</p=
></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Slot Type Selection</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Choose between Full Day or Time Slot based allocation</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Time Inputs</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Define Start Time and End Time for each slot</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Repeat Days</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Select days of the week for recurrence (e.g., Mon to Fri)</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Self-Blocked Checkbox</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Option to mark the slot as unavailable (self-blocked)</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Manpower Table</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Add manpower per lab/classroom with breakdown of roles, counts, and buff=
ers</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Save Button</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Stores configuration in system; updates view and status</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-6.TableColumns:.4"><strong>6. Table Columns:</strong=
></h3>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"b18c9d34-fd10-4224-bcb0-d33=
3608612d0" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Column</p></th>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Description</p></th>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Lab / Classroom Name</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Identifies the unit (e.g., Lab 1, Room A)</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Computers Available</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Auto-fetched from venue configuration</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Computers Offered</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Editable by user; number of systems being made available</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Buffers Available</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Buffer systems kept as standby</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Buffers Offered</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Buffer systems committed in offering</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Total Computers Offered</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Sum of Computers Offered + Buffers Offered (auto-calculated)</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<blockquote>
<p>The manpower calculation is tied to systems offered, so proper entry is =
crucial.</p>
</blockquote>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-7.UserActions:.2"><strong>7. User Actions:</strong><=
/h3>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"4add05c7-1b63-4a85-a32d-c78=
fac4f2dda" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Action</p></th>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Description</p></th>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Add Date Range</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Define start and end dates for manpower applicability</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Add Time Slot</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Choose Full Day or Time Slot and input relevant timings</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Select Repeat Days</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Apply same configuration across multiple weekdays</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Input Offered/Buffer Counts</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Enter values for systems and buffer availability</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Mark as Self-Blocked</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Indicate unavailability (optional)</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Save Configuration</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Store all data into backend; venue is considered =E2=80=9Cready=E2=80=9D=
 once manpower is defined</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-8.BusinessRules:.3"><strong>8. Business Rules:</stro=
ng></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Venue Owners can only manage manpower for <strong>their assigned venues<=
/strong></p></li>
<li>
<p>Both <strong>date range</strong> and <strong>time slot</strong> must be =
defined before saving</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Total Offered</strong> =3D Computers Offered + Buffers Offered (=
calculated automatically)</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>No overlapping configurations</strong> are allowed for the same =
venue/lab/date/time</p></li>
<li>
<p>A venue may have <strong>multiple valid configurations</strong> but only=
 one per date/time/lab can be active</p></li>
<li>
<p>Venue status may be flagged as incomplete if manpower is not yet configu=
red</p></li>
<li>
<p>Self-blocked dates/times override manpower availability</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-9.TriggerPoints:.3"><strong>9. Trigger Points:</stro=
ng></h3>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"6321b26d-6b9f-4b91-88b7-c1f=
277aea394" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Trigger</p></th>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Outcome</p></th>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Select Date Range</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Updates UI to allow configuration for that duration</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Add Slot Time</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Enables resource entry fields</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Click Save</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Validates and stores manpower configuration</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Toggle Self-Blocked</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Marks slot as unavailable for scheduling</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Modify Values</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Triggers real-time update of total count columns</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-10.Pre-Conditions:.3"><strong>10. Pre-Conditions:</s=
trong></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Venue Owner must be logged in with valid credentials</p></li>
<li>
<p>At least one venue must be mapped to their account</p></li>
<li>
<p>The selected date range must be within allowable configuration window (i=
f defined)</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-11.Post-Conditions:.3"><strong>11. Post-Conditions:<=
/strong></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Manpower details are saved for the venue</p></li>
<li>
<p>Data becomes visible for internal scheduling and reporting</p></li>
<li>
<p>Venue status may update to reflect readiness (if all configurations are =
completed)</p></li>
<li>
<p>Any changes are logged for audit tracking</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-12.IntegrationPoints:.2"><strong>12. Integration Poi=
nts:</strong></h3>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"00872ac1-3737-4ce0-94b9-099=
565d1463a" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>System</p></th>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Purpose</p></th>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Venue Management System</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Fetch venue and infrastructure details (labs, rooms, capacities)</p></td=
>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Role-Based Access (RBAC)</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Ensure Venue Owner can only access and edit mapped venues</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Exam Scheduling System</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Consumes manpower availability during scheduling</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Audit Trail Service</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Tracks every add/edit action with timestamp and user ID</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-13.ScreensReferenced:.1"><strong>13. Screens Referen=
ced:</strong></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Image:</strong> Manpower Configuration Screen</p></li>
</ul><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper c=
