<div id=3D"expander-51807037" class=3D"expand-container">
<div id=3D"expander-control-51807037" class=3D"expand-control">
<span class=3D"expand-control-icon"><img style=3D"vertical-align:middle;" c=
lass=3D"expand-control-image" src=3D"f21dae11798d2af9ea1168a5798afeb45451aa=
fce182619f3dbe43f2e8b53628" width=3D"16" height=3D"16"></span><span class=
=3D"expand-control-text">11. Manpower Management</span>
</div>
<div id=3D"expander-content-51807037" class=3D"expand-content">
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-1.Interface:.15"><strong>1. Interface:</strong></h3>
<p><strong>Service Management &gt; Manpower Page</strong></p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-2.Role:.15"><strong>2. Role:</strong></h3>
<p><strong>Venue Owner</strong><br>
(<em>Can add, edit, and view manpower records for their assigned venues.</e=
m>)</p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-3.Description:.15"><strong>3. Description:</strong><=
/h3>
<p>This screen enables Venue Owners to manage manpower by adding new users,=
 viewing existing personnel, and filtering them based on their status. It s=
upports both individual and bulk user creation, allowing Venue Owners to ma=
intain accurate and up-to-date manpower records for operational readiness.<=
/p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-4.AccessPoint:.5"><strong>4. Access Point:</strong><=
/h3>
<p>Main Sidebar =E2=86=92 <strong>Service Management</strong> =E2=86=92 <st=
rong>Manpower</strong></p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-5.FunctionalOverview:.5"><strong>5. Functional Overv=
iew:</strong></h3>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"e2ccc9b5-9031-477c-a95f-af2=
b4a912796" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Feature</p></th>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Description</p></th>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>User List Table</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Displays manpower details including User ID, Role, Name, Email, Contact,=
 etc.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Status Filters</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Toggle between All, Active, and Inactive manpower records</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Search Bar</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Search manpower by name</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Add New User Button</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Opens form to add individual manpower entries</p></td>
</tr>
