<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-1.Interface:.16"><strong>1. Interface:</strong></h3>
<p><strong>Service Management &gt; Devices Page</strong></p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-2.Role:.16"><strong>2. Role:</strong></h3>
<p><strong>Venue Owner</strong><br>
(<em>Can add, edit, and view device configurations for their assigned venue=
s.</em>)</p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-3.Description:.16"><strong>3. Description:</strong><=
/h3>
<p>This screen allows Venue Owners to manage the <strong>devices</strong> a=
llocated to their mapped venues. They can add new devices individually or v=
ia bulk upload, view existing device details, and filter them based on stat=
us or device type. This ensures accurate tracking and readiness of infrastr=
ucture for scheduled activities.</p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-4.AccessPoint:.6"><strong>4. Access Point:</strong><=
/h3>
<p>Main Sidebar =E2=86=92 <strong>Service Management</strong> =E2=86=92 <st=
rong>Devices</strong></p>
