<div id=3D"expander-content-326319420" class=3D"expand-content">
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-1.Interface:.17"><strong>1. Interface:</strong></h3>
<p><strong>Service Management &gt; Resolve Query Page</strong></p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-2.Role:.17"><strong>2. Role:</strong></h3>
<p><strong>Venue Owner</strong><br>
(<em>Can view, respond to, and resolve queries related to their assigned ve=
nues.</em>)</p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-3.Description:.17"><strong>3. Description:</strong><=
/h3>
<p>This screen enables Venue Owners to manage and resolve queries raised by=
 users regarding their mapped venues. They can view query details, respond =
to concerns, and update the status of each query. This ensures timely resol=
ution and accountability for venue-related issues.</p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-4.AccessPoint:.7"><strong>4. Access Point:</strong><=
/h3>
<p>Main Sidebar =E2=86=92 <strong>Service Management</strong> =E2=86=92 <st=
rong>Resolve Query</strong></p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-5.FunctionalOverview:.7"><strong>5. Functional Overv=
iew:</strong></h3>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"fb62a304-ef7d-4d68-98b5-296=
11a14dc4a" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Feature</p></th>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Description</p></th>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Query List Table</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Displays query details including Query ID, Raised By, Email, Contact Num=
ber, and Status</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Status Filters</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Toggle between All, Pending, In Progress, and Resolved queries</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Search Bar</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Search queries by keyword or user name</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>View Details Button</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Opens detailed view of the selected query</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Mark as Resolved Button</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Allows marking a query as resolved</p></td>
</tr>
