</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Status</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Current status of the query (Pending/In Progress/Resolved)</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-7.UserActions:.5"><strong>7. User Actions:</strong><=
/h3>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"64f7800a-5723-46dd-b9b8-53d=
283639be7" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Action</p></th>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Description</p></th>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>View Details</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Opens a panel showing full information about the selected query</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Mark as Resolved</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Updates the query status to =E2=80=9CResolved=E2=80=9D after addressing =
the concern</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Filter by Status</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>View queries based on their current status</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Search by Keyword</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Locate queries using name or keyword-based search</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-8.BusinessRules:.6"><strong>8. Business Rules:</stro=
ng></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Venue Owners can only manage queries for their assigned venues</p></li>
<li>
<p>Queries must be responded to within a predefined SLA (Service Level Agre=
ement)</p></li>
<li>
<p>Once marked as resolved, queries cannot be edited further</p></li>
<li>
<p>All actions are logged for audit purposes</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-9.TriggerPoints:.6"><strong>9. Trigger Points:</stro=
ng></h3>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"d58048ab-63a3-4d5d-b1c7-e67=
f9696fc9d" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Trigger</p></th>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Outcome</p></th>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Click View Details</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Opens detailed panel for viewing full query information</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Click Mark as Resolved</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Updates query status and logs resolution timestamp</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Select Status Filter</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Updates table view based on selected status</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Search by Keyword</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Filters table to show matching queries</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-10.Pre-Conditions:.6"><strong>10. Pre-Conditions:</s=
trong></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Venue Owner must be logged in with valid credentials</p></li>
<li>
<p>At least one venue must be mapped to their account</p></li>
<li>
<p>Query must be in Pending or In Progress status to be resolved</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-11.Post-Conditions:.6"><strong>11. Post-Conditions:<=
/strong></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Query status is updated to Resolved</p></li>
<li>
<p>Resolution timestamp and user ID are logged</p></li>
<li>
<p>Query becomes read-only for future reference</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
