<h2 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-C.VenueManager/Agent/Aggregator"><strong>C. Venue Ma=
nager / Agent / Aggregator</strong></h2>
<p>The <strong>Venue Manager / Agent / Aggregator</strong> is a registered =
user responsible for assisting in the operational management of venues on t=
he VBSA platform. After registration and email verification, they can reque=
st authorization from Venue Owners using valid venue codes. Once approved, =
they gain access to manage venue details, availability, and services. This =
role ensures secure, delegated control over venue operations through struct=
ured authorization workflows and role-based access.</p>
<div id=3D"expander-190962138" class=3D"expand-container">
<div id=3D"expander-control-190962138" class=3D"expand-control">
<span class=3D"expand-control-icon"><img style=3D"vertical-align:middle;" c=
lass=3D"expand-control-image" src=3D"f21dae11798d2af9ea1168a5798afeb45451aa=
fce182619f3dbe43f2e8b53628" width=3D"16" height=3D"16"></span><span class=
=3D"expand-control-text">1. Registers Self</span>
</div>
<div id=3D"expander-content-190962138" class=3D"expand-content">
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-1.Interface:.18"><strong>1. Interface:</strong></h3>
<p><strong>Venue Details Page =E2=86=92 Registration Form</strong></p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-2.Role:.18"><strong>2. Role:</strong></h3>
<p><strong>Venue Manager / Agent / Aggregator</strong></p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-3.Description:.18"><strong>3. Description:</strong><=
/h3>
<p>This functionality allows individuals acting as Venue Managers, Agents, =
or Aggregators to register themselves on the VBSA portal. Registration is i=
nitiated manually and is required before any venue management actions can b=
e taken.</p>
<h4 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-AccessPoint:.4"><strong>Access Point:</strong></h4>
<ul>
<li>
<p>User visits the <strong>Home Page</strong>.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Footer includes a link: <strong>=E2=80=9CManage a Venue=E2=80=9D</strong=
>.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Clicking the link redirects to the <strong>Venue Manager Registration Pa=
ge</strong>.</p></li>
</ul>
<h4 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-RegistrationFlow:"><strong>Registration Flow:</stron=
g></h4>
<ul>
<li>
<p>User fills out the registration form with the following fields:</p></li>
</ul>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"83deadb6-8637-429d-92fe-eb0=
54ddb8cf2" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr>
<th data-highlight-colour=3D"#f5f5f5" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Field Name</p></th>
<th data-highlight-colour=3D"#f5f5f5" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Type</p></th>
<th data-highlight-colour=3D"#f5f5f5" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Validation &amp; Requirements</p></th>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Name*</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Text</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Only letters and spaces; no special characters</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Email*</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Email</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Valid format; no spaces; no consecutive dots</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Gender*</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Radio Button</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Options: Male, Female, Others</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Contact*</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Numeric</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>10-digit number</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Alternate Contact</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Numeric</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Optional; same validation as Contact</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Password*</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Alphanumeric + Special</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Minimum 8 characters; at least one special character (@, #, $, etc.)</p>=
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Confirm Password*</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Alphanumeric + Special</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Must match Password</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<ul>
<li>
<p>If already registered, user sees: <strong>=E2=80=9CAlready Registered? L=
og in Now=E2=80=9D</strong>.</p></li>
</ul>
<h4 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-VerificationFlow:"><strong>Verification Flow:</stron=
g></h4>
<ul>
<li>
<p>On clicking <strong>Register</strong>, a verification link is sent to th=
e provided email.</p></li>
<li>
<p>User sees a confirmation screen prompting them to check their email.</p>=
</li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-4.Trigger:.10"><strong>4. Trigger:</strong></h3>
<p>Manual initiation by the user via the =E2=80=9CManage a Venue=E2=80=9D l=
ink.</p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-5.Pre-Condition:.10"><strong>5. Pre-Condition:</stro=
ng></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>User must not already be registered.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Must have a valid email address.</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-6.Post-Condition:.10"><strong>6. Post-Condition:</st=
rong></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>User receives a verification email.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Upon verification, user gains access to the portal and can proceed to re=
quest authorization (handled in a separate functionality).</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-7.BusinessRules:.10"><strong>7. Business Rules:</str=
ong></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Email verification is mandatory before accessing the portal.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Password must meet complexity requirements.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Duplicate registrations are not allowed.</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-8.Integration:.10"><strong>8. Integration:</strong><=
/h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Email Service</strong>: For sending verification links.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>RBAC (Role-Based Access Control)</strong>: To assign appropriate=
 roles post-registration.</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-9.Screens:.10"><strong>9. Screens:</strong></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Home Page Footer</strong>: =E2=80=9CManage a Venue=E2=80=9D link=
.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Registration Page</strong>: Form with all required fields and va=
lidations.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Email Verification Screen</strong>: Confirmation message with op=
tions to change email or resend link.</p></li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
<div id=3D"expander-672174053" class=3D"expand-container">
<div id=3D"expander-control-672174053" class=3D"expand-control">
<span class=3D"expand-control-icon"><img style=3D"vertical-align:middle;" c=
lass=3D"expand-control-image" src=3D"f21dae11798d2af9ea1168a5798afeb45451aa=
fce182619f3dbe43f2e8b53628" width=3D"16" height=3D"16"></span><span class=
=3D"expand-control-text">2. Requests Venue Owner to authorise and give conf=
irm rights</span>
</div>
<div id=3D"expander-content-672174053" class=3D"expand-content">
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-1.Interface:.19"><strong>1. Interface:</strong></h3>
<p><strong>Venue Details Page =E2=86=92 Authorization Request &amp; Listing=
</strong></p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-2.Role:.19"><strong>2. Role:</strong></h3>
<p><strong>Venue Manager / Agent / Aggregator</strong></p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-3.Description:.19"><strong>3. Description:</strong><=
/h3>
<p>This functionality enables registered <strong>Venue Managers / Agents / =
Aggregators</strong> to formally request authorization from <strong>Venue O=
wners</strong> to manage specific venues on the VBSA platform. The process =
is initiated by entering one or more valid <strong>Venue Codes</strong>=E2=
=80=94shared by the Venue Owner=E2=80=94and submitting a request through th=
e system.</p>
<p>Once submitted, the request appears in the Venue Owner=E2=80=99s dashboa=
rd with a <strong>Pending</strong> status. The Venue Owner can then choose =
to <strong>Approve</strong> or <strong>Reject</strong> the request. The Ven=
ue Manager can track the status of each request and take further actions su=
ch as <strong>Resend</strong> (if rejected) or <strong>Revoke</strong> (if =
pending or approved).</p>
<p>This functionality ensures secure and structured access control, allowin=
g only authorized personnel to manage venue operations. It is tightly integ=
rated with the platform=E2=80=99s <strong>RBAC (Role-Based Access Control)<=
/strong> system.</p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-4.Trigger:.11"><strong>4. Trigger:</strong></h3>
<p>Manual initiation by the Venue Manager / Agent / Aggregator after regist=
ration and login.</p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-5.Pre-Condition:.11"><strong>5. Pre-Condition:</stro=
ng></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>The user must be registered and verified.</p></li>
<li>
<p>The user must have a valid <strong>Venue Code</strong> shared by the Ven=
ue Owner.</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-6.Post-Condition:.11"><strong>6. Post-Condition:</st=
rong></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Authorization request is sent to the respective Venue Owner.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Request appears in the Venue Owner=E2=80=99s dashboard with status: <str=
ong>Pending</strong>.</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-7.BusinessRules:.11"><strong>7. Business Rules:</str=
ong></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Venue Code must be valid and match an existing venue in the system.</p><=
/li>
<li>
<p>Multiple venue codes can be added in a single request.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Duplicate venue codes are not allowed in the same request.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Venue Manager can:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Resend</strong> a request if it was rejected.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Revoke</strong> access if already approved.</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p>Statuses:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Pending</strong>: Request sent, awaiting approval.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Approved</strong>: Venue Owner has granted access.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Rejected</strong>: Venue Owner has denied access.</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-8.Integration:.11"><strong>8. Integration:</strong><=
/h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>RBAC (Role-Based Access Control)</strong>: To manage access righ=
ts post-approval.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Notification System</strong>: To alert Venue Owners of incoming =
requests.</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-9.Screens:.11"><strong>9. Screens:</strong></h3>
<h4 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-A.AuthorizationListingPage(fromImage_6):"><strong>A.=
 Authorization Listing Page</strong> (from Image_6):</h4>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Filters</strong>: All, Pending, Approved, Rejected</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Search Bar</strong>: Search by Venue Name or Venue Code</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Table Columns</strong>:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Venue Name (Code)</p></li>
<li>
<p>Location</p></li>
<li>
<p>Status (Pending, Approved, Rejected)</p></li>
<li>
<p>Actions:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Resend</strong> (if Rejected)</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Revoke</strong> (if Pending or Approved)</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<h4 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-B.RequestAuthorizationPage(fromImage_7):"><strong>B.=
 Request Authorization Page</strong> (from Image_7):</h4>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Instruction Text</strong>: =E2=80=9CEnter a valid Venue code to =
send a request.=E2=80=9D</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Venue Code Input Fields</strong>: Add multiple codes with delete=
 (X) option</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Buttons</strong>:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Discard</strong>: Clears the form</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Request Authorization</strong>: Sends the request to the respect=
ive Venue Owners</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper c=
onfluence-embedded-manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image ima=
