</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-6.2.SetPasswordForm:">6.2. Set Password Form:</h3>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"1759f577-1843-4435-ad83-f59=
55a17c632" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Field</p></th>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Description</p></th>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Enter Password</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>New secure password</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Confirm Password</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Re-enter same password for confirmation</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<hr>
<h2 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-7.BusinessRules:.12">7. <strong>Business Rules</stro=
ng>:</h2>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Auditors can register <strong>only through the invitation link</strong>.=
</p></li>
<li>
<p>Email field is <strong>non-editable</strong> for security and mapping re=
asons.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Email verification is <strong>mandatory</strong> before setting the pass=
word.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Password must be <strong>min 8 characters</strong>, include upper-lower =
case, number, and symbol.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Duplicate registrations for same email must be prevented.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Auditors <strong>must not be able to change role</strong> while register=
ing.</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h2 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-8.TriggerPoints:">8. <strong>Trigger Points</strong>=
:</h2>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"30bde67f-3134-4ed6-9f79-dfe=
ddafce464" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Trigger</p></th>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Outcome</p></th>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Project Head adds email of Auditor</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Sends invitation email with registration link</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Auditor clicks email link</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Redirects to pre-filled registration form</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Auditor submits registration</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Email verification link is sent</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Auditor verifies email</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Redirected to set password screen</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Auditor sets password</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>System creates login credentials</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Auditor logs in</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Access to venue audit features is granted</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<hr>
<h2 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-9.Pre-Conditions:">9. <strong>Pre-Conditions</strong=
>:</h2>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Auditor is invited by Project Head</p></li>
<li>
<p>Email address is valid and unique</p></li>
<li>
<p>Link clicked is within expiration window (e.g., 24=E2=80=9348 hours)</p>=
</li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h2 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-10.Post-Conditions:">10. <strong>Post-Conditions</st=
rong>:</h2>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Auditor becomes a registered user with =E2=80=9CVenue Auditor=E2=80=9D r=
ole</p></li>
<li>
<p>Associated with the invited project or subproject</p></li>
<li>
<p>Can view assigned venues and begin audit</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h2 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-11.IntegrationPoints:">11. <strong>Integration Point=
s</strong>:</h2>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"83af102f-482b-44fc-91e1-620=
e7564e516" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>System</p></th>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Purpose</p></th>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Email Service (e.g., SendGrid, AWS SES)</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Send invite and verification email</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>User Management &amp; Role Service</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Create account, assign Venue Auditor role</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Project Management Module</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Map auditor to invited project/subproject</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Audit Logging</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Log registration, verification, and login events</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<hr>
