<div id=3D"expander-content-1580114268" class=3D"expand-content">
<h2 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-1.Interface:.21">1. <strong>Interface</strong>:</h2>
<p>Audit &gt; Venues</p>
<hr>
<h2 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-2.Role:.21">2. <strong>Role</strong>:</h2>
<p><strong>Venue Auditor</strong><br>
(Internal or external auditor assigned by the Project Head to audit venues =
for a selected project or sub-project.)</p>
<hr>
<h2 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-3.Description:.21">3. <strong>Description</strong>:<=
/h2>
<p>This screen provides the <strong>Venue Auditor</strong> with a list of v=
enues assigned to them for a selected project. It enables them to:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>View venues assigned to them</p></li>
<li>
<p>Start an audit for a venue</p></li>
<li>
<p>View their previously submitted audits</p></li>
<li>
<p>Assign the audit task to a sub-auditor or third-party auditor (if needed=
)</p></li>
</ul>
<p>This screen does <strong>not</strong> show all venues, only those <stron=
g>assigned to the logged-in Venue Auditor</strong> by the Project Head.</p>
<hr>
<h2 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-4.AccessPoint:.9">4. <strong>Access Point</strong>:<=
/h2>
<p>From <strong>Sidebar Menu</strong> =E2=86=92 <code>Audit</code> =E2=86=
=92 <code>Venues</code></p>
<hr>
<h2 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-5.FunctionalOverview:.9">5. <strong>Functional Overv=
iew</strong>:</h2>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"83a29b3b-2575-454e-b737-634=
24782913b" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Feature</p></th>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Description</p></th>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Project Dropdown</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Lists projects/sub-projects where auditor is assigned</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Venue Listing</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Lists only venues assigned to the logged-in auditor</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Status Filters</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Tabs: All, Pending, Auditor Assigned, Audited, Approved, Rejected</p></t=
d>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Actions Column</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Start Audit, View Audit, Assign Audit</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Search</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Search by project or sub-project name</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Pagination</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Visible if venue list exceeds screen limit</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<hr>
