</div>
<hr>
<h2 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-8.ActionButtonsperVenue:">8. <strong>Action Buttons =
per Venue</strong>:</h2>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"3559004d-0945-41e6-927a-bbd=
c0aa00ae0" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Action</p></th>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Description</p></th>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Start Audit</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Redirects to Venue Owner Details Form and audit form</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>View Audit</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>View previously submitted audit details (read-only)</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Assign Audit</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Assign the audit of this venue to another auditor (external or internal)=
</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<blockquote>
<p><strong>Note:</strong> =E2=80=98View Audit=E2=80=99 appears only if an a=
udit has already been submitted by the logged-in user.<br>
=E2=80=98Assign Audit=E2=80=99 allows delegating the audit task. Assigned u=
ser receives an email notification (if external).</p>
</blockquote>
<hr>
<h2 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-9.BusinessRules:">9. <strong>Business Rules</strong>=
:</h2>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Auditor can view <strong>only venues assigned</strong> to them for the s=
elected project.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Dropdown shows only <strong>projects/sub-projects where auditor is mappe=
d</strong>.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Auditor can <strong>start audit only once per venue</strong> (unless rej=
ected and reopened).</p></li>
<li>
<p>Auditor can <strong>assign the audit</strong> only before starting it th=
emselves.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Once assigned, the venue status becomes <strong>"Auditor Assigned"</stro=
ng>.</p></li>
<li>
<p>If a venue=E2=80=99s audit is already submitted by the auditor, <strong>=
Start Audit is disabled</strong> and <strong>View Audit is enabled</strong>=
.</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h2 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-10.TriggerPoints:">10. <strong>Trigger Points</stron=
g>:</h2>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"a9d81bec-ee0a-4a93-a96a-d24=
a1bb71f9f" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Trigger</p></th>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Outcome</p></th>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Select project from dropdown</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Venue list loads for selected project</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Click Start Audit</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Redirects to audit form (pre-filled venue details)</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Click View Audit</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Shows previously submitted audit</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Click Assign Audit</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Opens modal to assign new auditor (manual entry or select internal audit=
or)</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Search Project/Sub-Project</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Filters venue list accordingly</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<hr>
<h2 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-11.Pre-Conditions:">11. <strong>Pre-Conditions</stro=
ng>:</h2>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Auditor has been invited and onboarded.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Auditor is assigned to the selected project by Project Head.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Project Head has assigned venues to this auditor.</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h2 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-12.Post-Conditions:">12. <strong>Post-Conditions</st=
rong>:</h2>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Submitted audits are linked to the auditor and venue</p></li>
<li>
<p>Assigned auditors receive assignment notification</p></li>
<li>
<p>Project Head can view the audit result in their dashboard</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
