<div id=3D"expander-content-2069573976" class=3D"expand-content">
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-1.Interface">1. <strong>Interface</strong></h3>
<p>Multi-step audit form interface accessed by <strong>Venue Auditor</stron=
g> post selecting <strong>Start Audit</strong> from the Audit Management sc=
reen.</p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-2.Role.2">2. <strong>Role</strong></h3>
<p><strong>Venue Auditor</strong></p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-3.Description">3. <strong>Description</strong></h3>
<p>Venue Auditors conduct detailed audits of venues prior to examination ev=
ents. The audit is structured as a guided, multi-step form to ensure all as=
pects=E2=80=94venue readiness, infrastructure, safety, power, and resources=
=E2=80=94are validated with supporting data and images.</p>
<p>Only the venues assigned to a specific auditor by the Project Head are a=
ccessible for auditing.</p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-4.AccessPoint">4. <strong>Access Point</strong></h3>
<p><strong>Sidebar =E2=86=92 Audit Management =E2=86=92 Start Audit</strong=
></p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-5.FunctionalOverview">5. <strong>Functional Overview=
</strong></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>The audit form consists of <strong>five steps</strong>, navigable in seq=
uence.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Step 1 is view-only with editable remarks.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Steps 2 to 5 are fully editable by the auditor.</p></li>
<li>
<p>File and image uploads are supported where required.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Final submission is only allowed when all steps are completed and valida=
ted.</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-6.FieldDetails">6. <strong>Field Details</strong></h=
3>
