<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-7.UserActions">7. <strong>User Actions</strong></h3>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"8f29b348-e0d9-4393-bd46-eeb=
6fec79553" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Action</p></th>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Description</p></th>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Start Audit</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Opens assigned venue in multi-step form</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Navigate Step</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Move across steps using =E2=80=9CNext=E2=80=9D / =E2=80=9CPrevious=E2=80=
=9D</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Upload File</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Upload image/doc for field-level validation</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Add Remarks</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Add observations in Step 1</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Submit Audit</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Final submission of audit after validations</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-8.BusinessRules.2">8. <strong>Business Rules</strong=
></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Venue Auditor can only audit venues assigned to them.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Venue Details (Step 1) are view-only, but auditor remarks are required.<=
/p></li>
<li>
<p>All fields marked mandatory must be filled before submission.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Each step must be validated before moving forward.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Image uploads are required where flagged.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Duplicate submissions for the same venue are blocked.</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-9.TriggerPoints">9. <strong>Trigger Points</strong><=
/h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Auditor clicks <strong>Start Audit</strong> for an assigned venue.</p></=
li>
<li>
<p>Multi-step form is initialized with pre-filled data.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Final submission triggers the audit storage and status change.</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-10.Pre-Conditions">10. <strong>Pre-Conditions</stron=
g></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Venue must be submitted by Venue Owner and assigned to Auditor.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Venue must not already be audited.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Auditor must be authenticated.</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-11.Post-Conditions">11. <strong>Post-Conditions</str=
ong></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Audit is stored in the system and marked <strong>Completed</strong>.</p>=
</li>
<li>
<p>Project Head can now review the audit data.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Audit trail is visible in venue audit history.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Venue Owner receives feedback if any action is required.</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-12.IntegrationPoints">12. <strong>Integration Points=
</strong></h3>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"54520ebb-8cab-4597-bd50-d0f=
dc262e5a5" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>System</p></th>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Purpose</p></th>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>MongoDB (Venue Data)</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Fetch and pre-fill venue information</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Audit DB (Audit Forms)</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Persist audit form data step-wise</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>AWS S3 / File Storage</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Store images and documents uploaded</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Notification Service</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Alert Project Head on completion</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-13.ScreenReferenced">13. <strong>Screen Referenced</=
strong></h3>
<p><code>Venue Auditor =E2=86=92 Start Audit =E2=86=92 Multi-Step Audit For=
m</code><br></p>
</div>
</div>
<h2 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-D.ServiceProvider"><strong>D. Service Provider</stro=
ng></h2>
<p>The <strong>Service Provider</strong> is an individual or organization o=
ffering services such as catering, accommodation, security, or other event-=
related support on the VBSA platform. After registration and email verifica=
tion, Service Providers can list, manage, and configure their offerings, li=
nk them to specific venues, and define availability and pricing. This role =
ensures a structured and compliant way to deliver services to clients and v=
enues across the platform.</p>
<div id=3D"expander-1854205726" class=3D"expand-container">
<div id=3D"expander-control-1854205726" class=3D"expand-control">
<span class=3D"expand-control-icon"><img style=3D"vertical-align:middle;" c=
lass=3D"expand-control-image" src=3D"f21dae11798d2af9ea1168a5798afeb45451aa=
fce182619f3dbe43f2e8b53628" width=3D"16" height=3D"16"></span><span class=
=3D"expand-control-text">1. Registers Self</span>
</div>
<div id=3D"expander-content-1854205726" class=3D"expand-content">
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-1.Purpose:"><strong>1. Purpose:</strong></h3>
<p>To enable individuals or organizations offering services (e.g., catering=
, decoration, photography, etc.) to register themselves on the VBSA platfor=
m as <strong>Service Providers</strong>, allowing them to list and manage t=
heir offerings.</p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-2.UserRole:"><strong>2. User Role:</strong></h3>
<p><strong>Service Provider</strong></p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-3.Description:.22"><strong>3. Description:</strong><=
/h3>
<p>This functionality allows a Service Provider to register on the VBSA por=
tal by filling out a form with personal and business details. The registrat=
ion process includes email verification to ensure authenticity and secure a=
ccess.</p>
<h4 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-RegistrationFlow:.1"><strong>Registration Flow:</str=
ong></h4>
<ol start=3D"1">
<li>
<p>User visits the <strong>Home Page</strong> and selects <strong>=E2=80=9C=
Service Provider=E2=80=9D</strong> from the role options.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Fills out the registration form with the following fields:</p></li>
</ol>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"7e6e3c2b-d507-429e-a329-644=
fd1766c32" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr>
<th data-highlight-colour=3D"#f5f5f5" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Field Name</p></th>
<th data-highlight-colour=3D"#f5f5f5" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Type</p></th>
<th data-highlight-colour=3D"#f5f5f5" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Validation &amp; Requirements</p></th>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>First Name*</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Text</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Only letters and spaces; no special characters</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Last Name*</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Text</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Same as First Name</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Company Name</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Text</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Optional</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Email*</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Email</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Valid format; no spaces; no consecutive dots</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Contact*</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Numeric</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Must be a 10-digit number</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<ol start=3D"3">
<li>
<p>Clicks <strong>Register</strong> to submit the form.</p></li>
<li>
<p>System sends a <strong>verification email</strong> to the provided addre=
ss.</p></li>
<li>
<p>User sees a confirmation screen (Image_9) with:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Message: =E2=80=9CCheck Your Mail!=E2=80=9D</p></li>
<li>
<p>Option to <strong>Resend Link</strong> if not received.</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p>Upon clicking the verification link, the user completes registration and=
 gains access to the portal.</p></li>
</ol>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-4.Trigger:.12"><strong>4. Trigger:</strong></h3>
<p>Manual initiation by the user via the registration form.</p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-5.Pre-Condition:.12"><strong>5. Pre-Condition:</stro=
ng></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>User must not already be registered.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Must have a valid email address.</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-6.Post-Condition:.12"><strong>6. Post-Condition:</st=
rong></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Verification email is sent.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Upon verification, user gains access to the VBSA portal as a Service Pro=
vider.</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-7.BusinessRules:.13"><strong>7. Business Rules:</str=
ong></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Email verification is mandatory before accessing the portal.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Duplicate registrations using the same email are not allowed.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Contact number must be valid and unique per user.</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-8.Integration:.12"><strong>8. Integration:</strong><=
/h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Email Service</strong>: For sending verification links.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>User Management System</strong>: To store and manage Service Pro=
vider profiles.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>RBAC (Role-Based Access Control)</strong>: To assign the Service=
 Provider role.</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-9.Screens:.12"><strong>9. Screens:</strong></h3>
<h4 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-A.RegistrationPage(Image_8):"><strong>A. Registratio=
n Page</strong> (Image_8):</h4>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Role Selector: Venue Owner / Service Provider</p></li>
<li>
<p>Input Fields: First Name, Last Name, Company Name, Email, Contact</p></l=
i>
<li>
<p>Button: <strong>Register</strong></p></li>
<li>
<p>Link: =E2=80=9CAlready User? Click Here to login=E2=80=9D</p></li>
</ul><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper c=
