<span class=3D"expand-control-icon"><img style=3D"vertical-align:middle;" c=
lass=3D"expand-control-image" src=3D"f21dae11798d2af9ea1168a5798afeb45451aa=
fce182619f3dbe43f2e8b53628" width=3D"16" height=3D"16"></span><span class=
=3D"expand-control-text">2 Service Listing, Addition, and Editing </span>
</div>
<div id=3D"expander-content-291962505" class=3D"expand-content">
<p><strong>Service Listing, Addition, and Editing</strong></p>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-1.Interface:.22"><strong>1. Interface:</strong></h3>
<p><strong>Service Management =E2=86=92 Add/Edit Services &amp; Service Lis=
ting Page</strong></p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-2.Role:.22"><strong>2. Role:</strong></h3>
<p><strong>Service Provider</strong></p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-3.Description:.23"><strong>3. Description:</strong><=
/h3>
<p>This functionality allows registered <strong>Service Providers</strong> =
to list, add, and manage services they offer on the VBSA platform. These se=
rvices can be venue-specific or independent (available across all venues). =
The system supports detailed configuration of service attributes, availabil=
ity, and linkage to venues.</p>
<h4 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-ServiceAdditionFlow(Image_10):"><strong>Service Addi=
tion Flow</strong> (Image_10):</h4>
<ul>
<li>
<p>User selects:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Service Scope</strong>: Venue Specific or Across All Venues</p><=
/li>
<li>
<p><strong>Service Type</strong>: Dropdown (e.g., Accommodation, Food &amp;=
 Beverage, Security, etc.)</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Service Name</strong></p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>PAN</strong> and <strong>GSTIN</strong> (Mandatory fields)</p></=
li>
<li>
<p><strong>Service Location</strong>: Country, State, City (Dropdowns)</p><=
/li>
<li>
<p><strong>Short Description</strong> (Max 100 words)</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Upload Image</strong> (Max 10MB)</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Nature of Service</strong>:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>If <strong>Venue Specific</strong>: Link to one or more venues via check=
boxes</p></li>
<li>
<p>If <strong>Independent</strong>: Venue linking section is hidden</p></li=
>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Service Availability</strong>:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Same at Venue</strong> or <strong>Time Slot</strong></p></li>
<li>
<p>Time slots can be configured per day of the week</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p>Clicks <strong>Save</strong> to store the service.</p></li>
</ul>
<h4 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-ServiceListing&amp;Management(Image_11):"><strong>Se=
rvice Listing &amp; Management</strong> (Image_11):</h4>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Displays a list of added services with the following columns:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Date Range</strong></p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Service Type</strong></p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Service Name</strong></p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Slot Type</strong></p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Service Nature</strong></p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Actions</strong>: Edit, Delete, View Details</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p>Filters:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Status: All, Active, Inactive</p></li>
<li>
<p>Search by Service Name or Nature</p></li>
<li>
<p>Filter by Service Type</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p>Button to <strong>Add New Service</strong></p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-4.Trigger:.13"><strong>4. Trigger:</strong></h3>
<p>Manual initiation by Service Provider to add or manage services.</p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-5.Pre-Condition:.13"><strong>5. Pre-Condition:</stro=
ng></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Service Provider must be registered and verified.</p></li>
<li>
<p>PAN and GSTIN must be valid.</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-6.Post-Condition:.13"><strong>6. Post-Condition:</st=
rong></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Service is stored and visible in the listing.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Linked venues (if any) are updated with service availability.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Service becomes available for booking or internal use.</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-7.BusinessRules:.14"><strong>7. Business Rules:</str=
ong></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>PAN and GSTIN are mandatory and must follow valid formats.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Description must not exceed 100 words.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Image upload must not exceed 10MB.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Venue linking is required for venue-specific services.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Availability must be defined before saving.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Services can be edited or deleted unless actively booked.</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-8.Integration:.13"><strong>8. Integration:</strong><=
/h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Document Storage</strong>: For service images.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Venue Management System</strong>: For linking services to venues=
.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Booking Engine</strong>: To reflect service availability.</p></l=
i>
<li>
<p><strong>Tax Validation API</strong>: Optional for PAN/GSTIN verification=
.</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-9.Screens:.13"><strong>9. Screens:</strong></h3>
<h4 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-A.Add/EditServiceForm(Image_10):"><strong>A. Add/Edi=
t Service Form</strong> (Image_10):</h4>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Fields for service details, location, tax info</p></li>
<li>
<p>Dropdowns for Country, State, City</p></li>
<li>
<p>Image upload section</p></li>
<li>
<p>Radio buttons for service nature</p></li>
<li>
<p>Venue linking checkboxes</p></li>
<li>
<p>Availability configuration (date/time slots)</p></li>
<li>
<p>Save button</p></li>
</ul><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper c=
onfluence-embedded-manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image ima=
