<h2 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-E.Client"><strong>E. Client</strong></h2>
<p>The <strong>Client</strong> is an individual or organization seeking to =
book venues and services on the VBSA platform for events, examinations, or =
training programs. After registration, Clients can manage their agents, exp=
lore venue availability through a color-coded calendar, raise queries witho=
ut selecting booking dates, and initiate booking requisitions with detailed=
 resource and service requirements. They can also request quotes, manage bo=
okings (including changes or cancellations), and rate their experience post=
-utilization. The Client role is central to the platform=E2=80=99s demand-s=
ide operations, ensuring seamless interaction with venues and service provi=
ders.</p>
<div id=3D"expander-1035955779" class=3D"expand-container">
<div id=3D"expander-control-1035955779" class=3D"expand-control">
<span class=3D"expand-control-icon"><img style=3D"vertical-align:middle;" c=
lass=3D"expand-control-image" src=3D"f21dae11798d2af9ea1168a5798afeb45451aa=
fce182619f3dbe43f2e8b53628" width=3D"16" height=3D"16"></span><span class=
=3D"expand-control-text">1. Self Registration and Client Agent Management</=
span>
</div>
<div id=3D"expander-content-1035955779" class=3D"expand-content">
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-1.Interface:.23"><strong>1. Interface:</strong></h3>
<p><strong>Client Registration Page =E2=86=92 Manage Agents Dashboard</stro=
ng></p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-2.Role:.23"><strong>2. Role:</strong></h3>
<p><strong>Client</strong></p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-3.Description:.24"><strong>3. Description:</strong><=
/h3>
<p>This functionality enables individuals or organizations to register them=
selves as <strong>Clients</strong> on the VBSA platform and manage their as=
sociated <strong>Client Agents</strong>. The registration process captures =
essential personal and company details, followed by access to a dashboard w=
here Clients can view, filter, and manage their agents.</p>
<h4 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-RegistrationFlow(Image_12):"><strong>Registration Fl=
ow</strong> (Image_12):</h4>
<ul>
<li>
<p>User selects the <strong>Client</strong> role and fills out the registra=
tion form with the following fields:</p></li>
</ul>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"d47a41de-05d1-45a0-a0e2-86e=
469e8777e" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr>
<th data-highlight-colour=3D"#f5f5f5" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Field Name</p></th>
<th data-highlight-colour=3D"#f5f5f5" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Type</p></th>
<th data-highlight-colour=3D"#f5f5f5" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Validation &amp; Requirements</p></th>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>First Name*</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Text</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Only letters and spaces; no special characters</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Last Name*</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Text</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Same as First Name</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Company Name</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Text</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Optional</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Email*</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Email</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Valid format; no spaces; no consecutive dots</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Contact*</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Numeric</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Must be a 10-digit number</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Clicks <strong>Register</strong> to submit the form.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Upon successful registration, the user gains access to the <strong>Clien=
t Dashboard</strong>.</p></li>
</ul>
<h4 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-AgentManagementFlow(Image_13):"><strong>Agent Manage=
ment Flow</strong> (Image_13):</h4>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Client navigates to <strong>Manage Agents</strong> section.</p></li>
<li>
<p>A table displays all agents with the following columns:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Email</strong></p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Name</strong></p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Company Name</strong></p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Contact</strong></p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Status</strong>: Pending, Active, Inactive</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Actions</strong>: Record, Delete</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p>Filters available:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>All</strong>, <strong>Pending</strong>, <strong>Active</strong>,=
 <strong>Inactive</strong></p></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p>A <strong>+Request</strong> button allows the Client to initiate a new a=
gent request.</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-4.Trigger:.14"><strong>4. Trigger:</strong></h3>
<p>Manual initiation by the user via the registration form and agent manage=
ment dashboard.</p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-5.Pre-Condition:.14"><strong>5. Pre-Condition:</stro=
ng></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>User must not already be registered.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Must have a valid email address and contact number.</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-6.Post-Condition:.14"><strong>6. Post-Condition:</st=
rong></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Client profile is created and stored.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Client gains access to agent management features.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Agents can be added, viewed, and managed.</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-7.BusinessRules:.15"><strong>7. Business Rules:</str=
ong></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Email and contact number must be unique per user.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Status transitions:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Pending</strong>: Agent request initiated</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Active</strong>: Agent approved and operational</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Inactive</strong>: Agent access revoked or paused</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p>Duplicate agent entries must be prevented.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Only registered Clients can manage agents.</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-8.Integration:.14"><strong>8. Integration:</strong><=
/h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>User Management System</strong>: To store and manage Client and =
Agent profiles.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Notification System</strong>: For agent status updates.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>RBAC (Role-Based Access Control)</strong>: To assign roles and p=
ermissions.</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-9.Screens:.14"><strong>9. Screens:</strong></h3>
<h4 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-A.ClientRegistrationPage(Image_12):"><strong>A. Clie=
nt Registration Page</strong> (Image_12):</h4>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Input Fields: First Name, Last Name, Company Name, Email, Contact</p></l=
i>
<li>
<p>Button: <strong>Register</strong></p></li>
</ul><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper c=
