<div id=3D"expander-87576309" class=3D"expand-container">
<div id=3D"expander-control-87576309" class=3D"expand-control">
<span class=3D"expand-control-icon"><img style=3D"vertical-align:middle;" c=
lass=3D"expand-control-image" src=3D"f21dae11798d2af9ea1168a5798afeb45451aa=
fce182619f3dbe43f2e8b53628" width=3D"16" height=3D"16"></span><span class=
=3D"expand-control-text">2. Centre Details and Availability by Day/Shift wi=
th Status Indicators</span>
</div>
<div id=3D"expander-content-87576309" class=3D"expand-content">
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-1.Interface:.24"><strong>1. Interface:</strong></h3>
<p><strong>Client Dashboard =E2=86=92 Centre Availability Calendar</strong>=
</p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-2.Role:.24"><strong>2. Role:</strong></h3>
<p><strong>Client</strong></p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-3.Description:.25"><strong>3. Description:</strong><=
/h3>
<p>This functionality allows Clients to view detailed information about cen=
tres (e.g., colleges, labs) and their availability across days and shifts. =
The availability is visually represented using a <strong>colour-coded calen=
dar</strong>, helping clients quickly understand the booking status of each=
 slot.</p>
<p>Clients can:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>View centre details such as name, location, and type.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Navigate a calendar to see availability by day and shift.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Identify booking statuses using colour codes.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Interact with the calendar to view more details or initiate booking acti=
ons.</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-4.Trigger:.15"><strong>4. Trigger:</strong></h3>
<p>Manual navigation by the Client to the Centre Availability section.</p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-5.Pre-Condition:.15"><strong>5. Pre-Condition:</stro=
ng></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Client must be logged in.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Centre data must be available in the system.</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-6.Post-Condition:.15"><strong>6. Post-Condition:</st=
rong></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Client can view availability and status of each shift.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Client can take further actions (e.g., request booking) based on availab=
ility.</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-7.BusinessRules:.16"><strong>7. Business Rules:</str=
ong></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Colour codes must be consistent across the platform.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Clients can only book or request slots that are not already booked or bl=
ocked.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Tooltip or hover text must display booking status and relevant details.<=
/p></li>
<li>
<p>Booking actions are restricted to authorized users.</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-8.FunctionalRequirements:"><strong>8. Functional Req=
uirements:</strong></h3>
<h4 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-8.1CentreDetails"><strong>8.1 Centre Details</strong=
></h4>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Display:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Centre Name</p></li>
<li>
<p>Location (e.g., College of Engineering &amp; Technology)</p></li>
<li>
<p>Type of Resource (e.g., Computer Labs)</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<h4 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-8.2AvailabilitybyDay/Shift"><strong>8.2 Availability=
 by Day/Shift</strong></h4>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Calendar view showing:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Dates</p></li>
<li>
<p>Time slots (e.g., Full Day, 12:01 AM =E2=80=93 11:59 PM)</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p>Clickable dates to expand shift-level details.</p></li>
</ul>
<h4 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-8.3Colour-CodedBookingStatus"><strong>8.3 Colour-Cod=
ed Booking Status</strong></h4>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Green</strong>: Requested (by self or others)</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Red</strong>: Booked (by others)</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Blue</strong>: Booked (by self)</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Yellow</strong>: Booking in discussion</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Grey</strong>: Blocked</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Orange</strong>: Subject to open on request</p></li>
</ul>
<h4 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-8.4UserInteraction"><strong>8.4 User Interaction</st=
rong></h4>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Hover over coloured blocks to view tooltips with:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Booking status</p></li>
<li>
<p>Booking party (self/others)</p></li>
<li>
<p>Time slot details</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p>Click to view or initiate booking (if permitted)</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-9.Non-FunctionalRequirements:"><strong>9. Non-Functi=
onal Requirements:</strong></h3>
<h4 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-9.1Usability"><strong>9.1 Usability</strong></h4>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Interface must be intuitive and mobile-responsive.</p></li>
</ul>
<h4 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-9.2Performance"><strong>9.2 Performance</strong></h4=
>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Calendar data should load within 2 seconds.</p></li>
</ul>
<h4 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-9.3Security"><strong>9.3 Security</strong></h4>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Only authorized users can view or request bookings.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Booking actions must be validated against user permissions.</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-10.Screens:.2"><strong>10. Screens:</strong></h3>
<h4 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-A.CalendarView"><strong>A. Calendar View</strong></h=
4>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Columns: Day, Date, Time Slots</p></li>
<li>
<p>Colour-coded blocks for each shift</p></li>
<li>
<p>Tooltip on hover</p></li>
<li>
<p>Clickable for more details</p></li>
</ul><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper c=
onfluence-embedded-manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image ima=
ge-center" alt=3D"image (17).jpg" width=3D"468" loading=3D"lazy" src=3D"507=
0f76566dde48a1482b2c2147ea5458dee0f78df2da5efaf011c7f871a77ff" data-image-s=
