<div id=3D"expander-1584794729" class=3D"expand-container">
<div id=3D"expander-control-1584794729" class=3D"expand-control">
<span class=3D"expand-control-icon"><img style=3D"vertical-align:middle;" c=
lass=3D"expand-control-image" src=3D"f21dae11798d2af9ea1168a5798afeb45451aa=
fce182619f3dbe43f2e8b53628" width=3D"16" height=3D"16"></span><span class=
=3D"expand-control-text">3. Request for Quote or Connect with Representativ=
e Based on Booking Requisition</span>
</div>
<div id=3D"expander-content-1584794729" class=3D"expand-content">
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-1.Interface:.25"><strong>1. Interface:</strong></h3>
<p><strong>Booking Requisition Page =E2=86=92 Quote Request / Connect Optio=
n</strong></p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-2.Role:.25"><strong>2. Role:</strong></h3>
<p><strong>Client</strong></p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-3.Description:.26"><strong>3. Description:</strong><=
/h3>
<p>This functionality enables Clients to initiate a <strong>Request for Quo=
te (RFQ)</strong> or connect with a representative based on a detailed book=
ing requisition. The requisition includes selected resources (e.g., compute=
r labs, classrooms) and linked services (e.g., workshops, training sessions=
), along with quantity and date details.</p>
<p>Clients can:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>View a <strong>summary of their booking requisition</strong>, including:=
</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Venue name and location (e.g., Government Polytechnic, Sakoli, District:=
 Bhandara)</p></li>
<li>
<p>Total number of items selected</p></li>
<li>
<p>Number of computer labs and linked services</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p>Review <strong>resource details</strong> such as:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Date range</p></li>
<li>
<p>Slot type (e.g., Full Day)</p></li>
<li>
<p>Number of labs or classrooms</p></li>
<li>
<p>Quantity of required resources</p></li>
<li>
<p>Option to remove any resource before submission</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p>Review <strong>service details</strong> such as:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Service name (e.g., Visualizing Data Entry Form, Workshop)</p></li>
<li>
<p>Date and slot</p></li>
<li>
<p>Quantity required</p></li>
<li>
<p>Option to remove any service</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p>Fill in <strong>billing address information</strong>, including:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Billing Entity</p></li>
<li>
<p>Bank Name</p></li>
<li>
<p>Account Number</p></li>
<li>
<p>IFSC Code</p></li>
<li>
<p>Address (Line 1 &amp; 2)</p></li>
<li>
<p>City, State, Country, and Pin Code</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p>Choose between two actions:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Request Quote</strong>: Submits the requisition for pricing and =
follow-up</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Pay Now</strong>: Proceeds directly to payment (if enabled)</p><=
/li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p>Upon clicking <strong>Request Quote</strong>, the system:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Validates that all required fields are filled</p></li>
<li>
<p>Submits the request to the backend</p></li>
<li>
<p>Notifies the relevant venue or service provider</p></li>
<li>
<p>Displays a confirmation message to the client</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-4.Trigger:.16"><strong>4. Trigger:</strong></h3>
<p>Manual initiation by the Client from the booking requisition interface.<=
/p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-5.Pre-Condition:.16"><strong>5. Pre-Condition:</stro=
ng></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Client must be logged in.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Booking requisition must include at least one resource or service.</p></=
li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-6.Post-Condition:.16"><strong>6. Post-Condition:</st=
rong></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Quote request is submitted to the system.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Notification sent to the relevant venue or service provider.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Client may receive a follow-up or quote document.</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-7.BusinessRules:.17"><strong>7. Business Rules:</str=
ong></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Quote can only be requested if required fields are filled (resources, se=
rvices, billing info).</p></li>
<li>
<p>Clients can remove resources/services before submission.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Billing details must be complete for quote generation.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Duplicate quote requests for the same requisition should be flagged.</p>=
</li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-8.Integration:.15"><strong>8. Integration:</strong><=
/h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Notification System</strong>: To alert venue/service provider of=
 incoming quote request.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Billing System</strong>: To store and validate billing details.<=
/p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Booking Engine</strong>: To link quote request with booking requ=
isition.</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-9.Screens:.15"><strong>9. Screens:</strong></h3>
<h4 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-A.BookingRequisitionPage:"><strong>A. Booking Requis=
ition Page</strong>:</h4>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Sections:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Order Summary</p></li>
<li>
<p>Resources (with date, slot, quantity)</p></li>
<li>
<p>Services (with date, slot, quantity)</p></li>
<li>
<p>Billing Address Form</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p>Actions:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Remove Resource/Service</p></li>
<li>
<p>Request Quote</p></li>
<li>
<p>Pay Now</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper c=
onfluence-embedded-manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image ima=
ge-center" alt=3D"image (19).png" width=3D"468" loading=3D"lazy" src=3D"0c3=
2b059d7d5b1a16f352e9f58975d9a6da6059663d795852feb118a4491c889" data-image-s=
rc=3D"https://hubblehoxtech.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/3887595=
54/image%20(19).png?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D1751543677850&amp;ca=
cheVersion=3D1&amp;api=3Dv2" data-height=3D"974" data-width=3D"1026" data-u=
nresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=3D"389349401" data-li=
nked-resource-version=3D"1" data-linked-resource-type=3D"attachment" data-l=
inked-resource-default-alias=3D"image (19).png" data-base-url=3D"https://hu=
bblehoxtech.atlassian.net/wiki" data-linked-resource-content-type=3D"image/=
png" data-linked-resource-container-id=3D"388759554" data-linked-resource-c=
ontainer-version=3D"26" data-media-id=3D"68f4bc2d-58f5-46eb-bec4-3f5d231c2b=
83" data-media-type=3D"file" height=3D"444"></span>
</div>
</div>
