<div id=3D"expander-control-1972848292" class=3D"expand-control">
<span class=3D"expand-control-icon"><img style=3D"vertical-align:middle;" c=
lass=3D"expand-control-image" src=3D"f21dae11798d2af9ea1168a5798afeb45451aa=
fce182619f3dbe43f2e8b53628" width=3D"16" height=3D"16"></span><span class=
=3D"expand-control-text">4. Raise a Query to Help Desk Without Selecting Bo=
oking Dates</span>
</div>
<div id=3D"expander-content-1972848292" class=3D"expand-content">
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-1.Interface:.26"><strong>1. Interface:</strong></h3>
<p><strong>Help Desk =E2=86=92 Query Submission Form</strong></p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-2.Role:.26"><strong>2. Role:</strong></h3>
<p><strong>Client</strong></p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-3.Description:.27"><strong>3. Description:</strong><=
/h3>
<p>This functionality allows Clients to raise queries related to venues, se=
rvices, or general concerns <strong>without needing to select booking dates=
</strong>. It provides a flexible communication channel for clarifications,=
 support, or pre-booking inquiries.</p>
<p>Clients can:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Access the <strong>Help Desk</strong> or <strong>Query Submission</stron=
g> section from the dashboard.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Choose the <strong>type of query</strong>:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>General Query</p></li>
<li>
<p>Venue Related Query</p></li>
<li>
<p>Service Related Query</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p>Fill in personal details:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Name</p></li>
<li>
<p>Email ID</p></li>
<li>
<p>Mobile Number</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p>Select relevant context:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>City (e.g., Nashik)</p></li>
<li>
<p>Venue or Service (e.g., Nashik College of Engineering or Om CCTV Service=
s)</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p>Enter the query in a free-text field (up to 300 characters).</p></li>
<li>
<p>Submit the query using the <strong>Submit</strong> button.</p></li>
</ul>
<p>Once submitted, the query is logged and routed to the appropriate suppor=
t team or entity (venue/service provider/helpdesk). Clients can view respon=
ses and continue the conversation in a threaded format.</p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-4.Trigger:.17"><strong>4. Trigger:</strong></h3>
<p>Manual initiation by the Client from the Help Desk or Query section.</p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-5.Pre-Condition:.17"><strong>5. Pre-Condition:</stro=
ng></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Client must be logged in.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Must provide valid contact details and select query type.</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-6.Post-Condition:.17"><strong>6. Post-Condition:</st=
rong></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Query is submitted and stored in the system.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Notification sent to the relevant recipient (venue, service provider, or=
 helpdesk).</p></li>
<li>
<p>Client can view and respond to replies.</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-7.BusinessRules:.18"><strong>7. Business Rules:</str=
ong></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Query must be under 300 characters.</p></li>
<li>
<p>City and venue/service selection is mandatory for venue/service-related =
queries.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Duplicate queries should be flagged or grouped.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Only registered users can submit queries.</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-8.Integration:.16"><strong>8. Integration:</strong><=
/h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Notification System</strong>: To alert recipients of new queries=
.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Query Management System</strong>: To store, track, and respond t=
o queries.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>User Profile System</strong>: To auto-fill user details where ap=
plicable.</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-9.Screens:.16"><strong>9. Screens:</strong></h3>
<h4 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-A.QuerySubmissionForm:"><strong>A. Query Submission =
Form</strong>:</h4>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Fields:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Name</p></li>
<li>
<p>Email ID</p></li>
<li>
<p>Mobile No.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Type of Query (dropdown)</p></li>
<li>
<p>City (dropdown)</p></li>
<li>
<p>Venue or Service (dropdown)</p></li>
<li>
<p>Query (text box)</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p>Button: <strong>Submit</strong></p></li>
</ul>
<h4 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-B.QueryThreadView:"><strong>B. Query Thread View</st=
rong>:</h4>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Displays submitted queries and responses</p></li>
<li>
<p>Shows timestamps, sender identity, and message content</p></li>
</ul><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper c=
onfluence-embedded-manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image ima=
ge-center" alt=3D"image (18).jpg" width=3D"468" loading=3D"lazy" src=3D"fb7=
