<div id=3D"expander-control-1045811460" class=3D"expand-control">
<span class=3D"expand-control-icon"><img style=3D"vertical-align:middle;" c=
lass=3D"expand-control-image" src=3D"f21dae11798d2af9ea1168a5798afeb45451aa=
fce182619f3dbe43f2e8b53628" width=3D"16" height=3D"16"></span><span class=
=3D"expand-control-text">5. Change / Cancel Bookings if permitted in contra=
ct.</span>
</div>
<div id=3D"expander-content-1045811460" class=3D"expand-content">
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-1.Interface:.27"><strong>1. Interface:</strong></h3>
<p><strong>Booking Management Screen</strong></p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-2.Role:.27"><strong>2. Role:</strong></h3>
<p><strong>Client</strong></p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-3.Description:.28"><strong>3. Description:</strong><=
/h3>
<p>This functionality allows registered Clients to <strong>change or cancel=
 bookings</strong> on the VBSA portal, subject to the terms defined in thei=
r contract with the Venue Owner.</p>
<h4 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-AccessPoint:.5"><strong>Access Point:</strong></h4>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Client logs into the VBSA portal.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Navigates to <strong>My Bookings</strong> or <strong>Booking History</st=
rong> section.</p></li>
</ul>
<h4 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-BookingDetailsPage:"><strong>Booking Details Page:</=
strong></h4>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Displays booking information including:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Venue Name</p></li>
<li>
<p>Booking Date</p></li>
<li>
<p>Resource Type (e.g., Classroom, Computer Labs)</p></li>
<li>
<p>Status (e.g., Confirmed, Cancelled by Venue)</p></li>
<li>
<p>Requested Date &amp; Slot</p></li>
<li>
<p>Linked Services (e.g., Om Proctoring, Security)</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<h4 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-ActionButtons(Conditional):"><strong>Action Buttons =
(Conditional):</strong></h4>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Change Booking</strong> =E2=80=93 Enabled if contract permits mo=
difications.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Cancel Booking</strong> =E2=80=93 Enabled if cancellation is all=
owed.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>View Contract PDF</strong> =E2=80=93 For reference.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Remarks Section</strong> =E2=80=93 View-only comments from Venue=
 or Client.</p></li>
</ul>
<h4 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-ChangeFlow:"><strong>Change Flow:</strong></h4>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Client clicks <strong>Change Booking</strong>.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Editable fields appear (e.g., date, time, resource type).</p></li>
<li>
<p>Upon submission, a confirmation screen appears.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Notification sent to Venue Owner for approval (if required).</p></li>
</ul>
<h4 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-CancelFlow:"><strong>Cancel Flow:</strong></h4>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Client clicks <strong>Cancel Booking</strong>.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Confirmation prompt appears.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Upon confirmation, booking status updates to <em>Cancelled by Client</em=
>.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Notification sent to Venue Owner.</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-4.Trigger:.18"><strong>4. Trigger:</strong></h3>
<p>Manual initiation by the Client from the booking details interface.</p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-5.Pre-Condition:.18"><strong>5. Pre-Condition:</stro=
ng></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Client must be logged in.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Booking must exist and be eligible for change/cancellation as per contra=
ct.</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-6.Post-Condition:.18"><strong>6. Post-Condition:</st=
rong></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Booking status is updated.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Notifications are sent to relevant stakeholders.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Audit trail is maintained.</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-7.BusinessRules:.19"><strong>7. Business Rules:</str=
ong></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Changes/Cancellations are only allowed if explicitly permitted in the co=
ntract.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Booking status must reflect the latest action (e.g., Cancelled by Client=
).</p></li>
<li>
<p>Linked services must be updated accordingly.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Venue Owner may have override rights depending on contract terms.</p></l=
i>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-8.Integration:.17"><strong>8. Integration:</strong><=
/h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Contract Management System</strong> =E2=80=93 To verify permissi=
ons.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Notification System</strong> =E2=80=93 For alerts and confirmati=
ons.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Audit Logging</strong> =E2=80=93 For tracking changes.</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-9.Screens:.17"><strong>9. Screens:</strong></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Booking History / My Bookings</strong></p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Booking Details Page</strong>:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Action buttons: <em>Change</em>, <em>Cancel</em>, <em>View PDF</em></p><=
/li>
<li>
<p>Remarks section</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Change Booking Form</strong></p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Cancellation Confirmation Prompt</strong></p></li>
</ul>
