<div id=3D"expander-control-1085724019" class=3D"expand-control">
<span class=3D"expand-control-icon"><img style=3D"vertical-align:middle;" c=
lass=3D"expand-control-image" src=3D"f21dae11798d2af9ea1168a5798afeb45451aa=
fce182619f3dbe43f2e8b53628" width=3D"16" height=3D"16"></span><span class=
=3D"expand-control-text">6. Rates Centre</span>
</div>
<div id=3D"expander-content-1085724019" class=3D"expand-content">
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-1.Interface:.28"><strong>1. Interface:</strong></h3>
<p><strong>Rates Centre</strong></p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-2.Role:.28"><strong>2. Role:</strong></h3>
<p><strong>Client</strong></p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-3.Description:.29"><strong>3. Description:</strong><=
/h3>
<p>This functionality allows Clients to <strong>rate their experience</stro=
ng> with a venue after a booking has been completed and utilized. It also s=
upports <strong>event-based booking configuration</strong> and <strong>reso=
urce allocation</strong> across multiple dates.</p>
<h4 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-AccessPoint:.6"><strong>Access Point:</strong></h4>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Client logs into the VBSA portal.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Navigates to <strong>My Bookings</strong> or <strong>Rates Centre</stron=
g> after a booking is completed.</p></li>
</ul>
<h4 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-EventSelection&amp;BookingConfiguration:"><strong>Ev=
ent Selection &amp; Booking Configuration:</strong></h4>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Dropdown to select event type: <em>C-DAC, MHCET, SSC, MPSC, Others</em><=
/p></li>
<li>
<p>If "Others" is selected, event details section is hidden.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Event Details (if applicable):</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Event Days</strong>: Select from Sun to Sat</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Event Name</strong></p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Start Date</strong> and <strong>End Date</strong></p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Slot Type</strong>: Full Day</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Venue Required</strong></p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Venue Time</strong>: 6:00 AM to 9:00 PM</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Required Resource Type</strong>: Computer Lab, Classroom</p></li=
>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<h4 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-BookingDatesSelection:"><strong>Booking Dates Select=
ion:</strong></h4>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Calendar interface to select available booking dates.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Dates shown: 25-06-2025, 26-06-2025, 01-07-2025, 02-07-2025, 09-07-2025,=
 16-07-2025</p></li>
<li>
<p>Checkbox to apply selected resource values to all subsequent dates from =
a selected date.</p></li>
</ul>
<h4 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-Rating&amp;Feedback:"><strong>Rating &amp; Feedback:=
</strong></h4>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Appears <strong>only after</strong> the venue has been booked and utiliz=
ed.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Rating Scale</strong>: 1 to 5 stars</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Comment Box</strong>: Optional feedback</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-4.Trigger:.19"><strong>4. Trigger:</strong></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Manual initiation by the Client after booking completion.</p></li>
<li>
<p>System-triggered display of rating interface post-utilization.</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-5.Pre-Condition:.19"><strong>5. Pre-Condition:</stro=
ng></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Booking must be completed and marked as utilized.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Client must be logged in.</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-6.Post-Condition:.19"><strong>6. Post-Condition:</st=
rong></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Rating and comments are stored in the system.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Feedback is linked to the specific venue and booking.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Venue availability and resource allocation are updated.</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-7.BusinessRules:.20"><strong>7. Business Rules:</str=
ong></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Rating interface is only visible after venue utilization.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Event details are hidden if "Others" is selected.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Resource values can be applied in bulk to multiple dates.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Only available dates can be selected for booking.</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-8.Integration:.18"><strong>8. Integration:</strong><=
/h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Booking Engine</strong> =E2=80=93 For date and resource selectio=
n</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Feedback System</strong> =E2=80=93 For storing ratings and comme=
nts</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Calendar Module</strong> =E2=80=93 For date navigation and selec=
tion</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-9.Screens:.18"><strong>9. Screens:</strong></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Event Selection &amp; Booking Configuration</strong></p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Calendar View for Booking Dates</strong></p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Rating Interface</strong> (post-booking)</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Star rating</p></li>
<li>
<p>Comment box</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Referenced Image</strong>: Image 4</p><span class=3D"confluence-=
embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size"=
><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image image-center" alt=3D"image (20).pn=
g" width=3D"468" loading=3D"lazy" src=3D"eed86e71b4bfd753b85ee032626cc3b5a1=
