<div id=3D"expander-289125342" class=3D"expand-container">
<div id=3D"expander-control-289125342" class=3D"expand-control">
<span class=3D"expand-control-icon"><img style=3D"vertical-align:middle;" c=
lass=3D"expand-control-image" src=3D"f21dae11798d2af9ea1168a5798afeb45451aa=
fce182619f3dbe43f2e8b53628" width=3D"16" height=3D"16"></span><span class=
=3D"expand-control-text">7. Payment</span>
</div>
<div id=3D"expander-content-289125342" class=3D"expand-content">
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-1.Interface:.29">1. Interface:</h3>
<p><strong>Booking Requisition Page =E2=86=92 Pay Now Option</strong></p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-2.Role:.29">2. Role:</h3>
<p><strong>Client</strong></p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-3.Description:.30">3. Description:</h3>
<p>This functionality enables Clients to make secure online payments for co=
nfirmed bookings using an integrated payment gateway. The payment process s=
upports <strong>multi-party settlements</strong> where a single payment fro=
m the Client is automatically split among multiple <strong>Venue Owners</st=
rong> and <strong>Service Providers</strong>, along with the platform owner=
, based on predefined commission rules.</p>
<p>Clients can:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>View a <strong>Payment Summary</strong> before initiating payment, inclu=
ding:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Order ID</strong> (e.g., #123)</p></li>
<li>
<p>Venue name(s) and location(s)</p></li>
<li>
<p>Services linked to the booking</p></li>
<li>
<p>Total payable amount</p></li>
<li>
<p>Breakdown of charges per Venue Owner and Service Provider (for transpare=
ncy)</p></li>
<li>
<p>Platform commission (if applicable)</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p>Choose a <strong>Payment Method</strong>:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Credit/Debit Card</p></li>
<li>
<p>Net Banking</p></li>
<li>
<p>UPI</p></li>
<li>
<p>Wallets</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p>Confirm billing details:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Billing Entity</p></li>
<li>
<p>Address (Line 1 &amp; 2)</p></li>
<li>
<p>City, State, Country, Pin Code</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p>Initiate payment via <strong>Pay Now</strong> button.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Receive real-time confirmation and digital receipt.</p></li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Payment Mechanism:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Client makes a <strong>single consolidated payment</strong> for the enti=
re booking.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Payment Gateway automatically:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Splits the amount among multiple Venue Owners and Service Providers base=
d on their respective item values.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Deducts platform commission (e.g., 10%) before settlement.</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p>Example:</p></li>
<li><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper co=
nfluence-embedded-manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image imag=
e-center" alt=3D"merchant-payment.png" width=3D"468" loading=3D"lazy" src=
=3D"b670c326534685f7bb53d229babd5a23d1d03142addae8a30f57c456e4eb6bb4" data-=
image-src=3D"https://hubblehoxtech.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/=
388759554/merchant-payment.png?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D176240792=
3329&amp;cacheVersion=3D1&amp;api=3Dv2" data-height=3D"621" data-width=3D"1=
091" data-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=3D"5939855=
49" data-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-linked-resource-type=3D"attachm=
ent" data-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"merchant-payment.png" data-base-=
url=3D"https://hubblehoxtech.atlassian.net/wiki" data-linked-resource-conte=
nt-type=3D"image/png" data-linked-resource-container-id=3D"388759554" data-=
linked-resource-container-version=3D"26" data-media-id=3D"d799934f-4b7a-4cd=
6-99fd-4857a6ddbe9e" data-media-type=3D"file" height=3D"266"></span>
<p></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Venue Owner-1: =E2=82=B9100 =E2=86=92 Receives =E2=82=B990</p></li>
<li>
<p>Venue Owner-2: =E2=82=B9300 =E2=86=92 Receives =E2=82=B9270</p></li>
<li>
<p>Service Provider-1: =E2=82=B9700 =E2=86=92 Receives =E2=82=B9630</p></li=
>
<li>
<p>Service Provider-2: =E2=82=B9400 =E2=86=92 Receives =E2=82=B9360</p></li=
>
<li>
<p>Service Provider-3: =E2=82=B9200 =E2=86=92 Receives =E2=82=B9180</p></li=
>
<li>
<p>Platform Owner: Receives =E2=82=B910% commission.</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-4.Trigger:.20">4. Trigger:</h3>
<p>Manual initiation by the Client by clicking <strong>Pay Now</strong> on =
the booking requisition page.</p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-5.Pre-Condition:.20">5. Pre-Condition:</h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Client must be logged in.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Booking requisition must be confirmed and have a valid payable amount.</=
p></li>
<li>
<p>Payment gateway integration must be active.</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-6.Post-Condition:.20">6. Post-Condition:</h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Payment status updated to <strong>Paid</strong>.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Digital receipt generated and stored.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Notifications sent to:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Client (payment confirmation)</p></li>
<li>
<p>Venue Owner(s)</p></li>
<li>
<p>Service Provider(s)</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p>Settlement initiated to respective parties and platform account.</p></li=
>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-7.BusinessRules:.21">7. Business Rules:</h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Payment can only be initiated for confirmed bookings.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Split settlement percentages must follow platform-defined rules.</p></li=
>
<li>
<p>Platform commission deducted before settlement.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Refunds (if applicable) will follow separate refund policy workflow.</p>=
</li>
<li>
<p>Duplicate payments must be prevented.</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-8.Integration:.19">8. Integration:</h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Payment Gateway API</strong>: For secure transaction processing =
and split settlements.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Booking Engine</strong>: To update payment status.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Notification System</strong>: For alerts and confirmations.</p><=
/li>
<li>
<p><strong>Accounting Module</strong>: For ledger entries and reconciliatio=
n.</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-9.Screens:.19">9. Screens:</h3>
<p><strong>A. Payment Summary Page</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Sections:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Order Details</p></li>
<li>
<p>Venue Owner &amp; Service Provider Breakdown</p></li>
<li>
<p>Total Amount</p></li>
<li>
<p>Platform Commission</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p>Actions:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Select Payment Method</p></li>
<li>
<p>Pay Now</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<p><strong>B. Payment Confirmation Screen</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Displays transaction ID, amount paid, and settlement details.</p></li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
<hr>
<div id=3D"expander-1896070670" class=3D"expand-container">
<div id=3D"expander-control-1896070670" class=3D"expand-control">
<span class=3D"expand-control-icon"><img style=3D"vertical-align:middle;" c=
lass=3D"expand-control-image" src=3D"f21dae11798d2af9ea1168a5798afeb45451aa=
fce182619f3dbe43f2e8b53628" width=3D"16" height=3D"16"></span><span class=
=3D"expand-control-text">8. Cancel booking and refund</span>
</div>
<div id=3D"expander-content-1896070670" class=3D"expand-content">
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-1.Interface:.30">1. Interface:</h3>
<p><strong>Booking Management Page =E2=86=92 Cancel Booking &amp; Refund St=
atus</strong></p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-2.Role:.30">2. Role:</h3>
<p><strong>Client</strong></p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-3.Description:.31">3. Description:</h3>
<p>This functionality enables Clients to cancel confirmed bookings and rece=
ive refunds online based on the <strong>Refund Policy configured by the Pro=
ject Head</strong> for the respective project. The refund amount is calcula=
ted dynamically according to the cancellation window and policy rules (e.g.=
, 100% refund if canceled 30 days before event, 50% refund if canceled 15=
=E2=80=9330 days before, no refund if less than 15 days).</p>
<p>Clients can:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>View <strong>Booking Details</strong>:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Venue name and location</p></li>
<li>
<p>Services linked to the booking</p></li>
<li>
<p>Booking date and slot</p></li>
<li>
<p>Current status (Confirmed, Pending, etc.)</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p>Access <strong>Refund Policy Summary</strong>:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Display rules applicable for the project (e.g., day ranges and refund pe=
rcentages)</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p>Initiate <strong>Cancellation</strong>:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Click <strong>Cancel Booking</strong> button</p></li>
<li>
<p>Provide optional remarks</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p>View <strong>Refund Calculation</strong>:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Total paid amount</p></li>
<li>
<p>Refund percentage based on policy</p></li>
<li>
<p>Final refund amount</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p>Confirm cancellation and refund initiation</p></li>
<li>
<p>Track <strong>Refund Status</strong>:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Pending, Processed, Credited</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<p>Refunds are processed online through the integrated payment gateway and =
credited to the Client=E2=80=99s original payment method.</p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-4.Trigger:.21">4. Trigger:</h3>
<p>Manual initiation by the Client by clicking <strong>Cancel Booking</stro=
ng> on the booking details page.</p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-5.Pre-Condition:.21">5. Pre-Condition:</h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Client must be logged in.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Booking must be confirmed and eligible for cancellation.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Refund policy must be configured by Project Head for the project.</p></l=
i>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-6.Post-Condition:.21">6. Post-Condition:</h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Booking status updated to <strong>Cancelled by Client</strong>.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Refund amount calculated and initiated.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Notifications sent to:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Client (refund confirmation)</p></li>
<li>
<p>Venue Owner(s)</p></li>
<li>
<p>Service Provider(s)</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p>Refund transaction recorded in system.</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-7.BusinessRules:.22">7. Business Rules:</h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Refund percentage is based on <strong>Project Head=E2=80=99s configured =
policy</strong>:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Example:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>=E2=89=A530 days before event =E2=86=92 100% refund</p></li>
<li>
<p>15=E2=80=9330 days =E2=86=92 50% refund</p></li>
<li>
<p>&lt;15 days =E2=86=92 No refund</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p>Refund applies only to confirmed bookings.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Refund is credited to the original payment method.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Cancellation is not allowed after event start date.</p></li>
<li>
<p>System must log all cancellation and refund actions for audit.</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-8.Integration:.20">8. Integration:</h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Payment Gateway API</strong>: For refund processing.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Booking Engine</strong>: To update booking status.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Notification System</strong>: For alerts and confirmations.</p><=
/li>
<li>
<p><strong>Accounting Module</strong>: For ledger entries and reconciliatio=
n.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Project Configuration Service</strong>: To fetch refund policy r=
ules.</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-9.Screens:.20">9. Screens:</h3>
<p><strong>A. Booking Details Page</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Sections:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Booking Summary</p></li>
<li>
<p>Refund Policy Display</p></li>
<li>
<p>Refund Calculation Preview</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p>Actions:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Cancel Booking</p></li>
<li>
<p>Confirm Cancellation</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<p><strong>B. Refund Status Page</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Displays:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Refund Amount</p></li>
<li>
<p>Transaction ID</p></li>
<li>
<p>Status (Pending, Processed, Credited)</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
<hr>
<h2 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-F.ClientAgent"><strong>F. Client Agent</strong></h2>
<p>A <strong>Client Agent</strong> on the VBSA platform is responsible for =
initiating and managing authorization requests to Clients by entering their=
 email addresses. They can also book venues on behalf of Clients once autho=
rization is approved.</p>
<div id=3D"expander-1464861669" class=3D"expand-container">
<div id=3D"expander-control-1464861669" class=3D"expand-control">
<span class=3D"expand-control-icon"><img style=3D"vertical-align:middle;" c=
lass=3D"expand-control-image" src=3D"f21dae11798d2af9ea1168a5798afeb45451aa=
fce182619f3dbe43f2e8b53628" width=3D"16" height=3D"16"></span><span class=
=3D"expand-control-text">1. Self registration &amp; Email Verification</spa=
n>
</div>
<div id=3D"expander-content-1464861669" class=3D"expand-content">
<h4 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-1.Interface:.31"><strong>1. Interface:</strong></h4>
<p><strong>Client Agent Registration Page =E2=86=92 Agent Dashboard (Limite=
d Access)</strong></p>
<hr>
<h4 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-2.Role:.31"><strong>2. Role:</strong></h4>
<p><strong>Client Agent</strong></p>
<hr>
<h4 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-3.Description:.32"><strong>3. Description:</strong><=
/h4>
<p>This functionality allows individuals to register themselves as Client A=
gents on the VBSA platform. The registration process captures personal and =
professional details. Upon submission, a <strong>verification email</strong=
> is sent to the Agent's email address. Once verified, the Agent gains acce=
ss to a limited dashboard with their profile and status.</p>
<hr>
<h4 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-4.RegistrationFlow:"><strong>4. Registration Flow:</=
strong></h4>
<p><strong>User selects the Client Agent role and fills out the registratio=
n form with the following fields:</strong></p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"4decd159-a8c9-417d-bd3a-409=
2aa8445d5" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<colgroup>
<col style=3D"width: 244.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 122.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 364.0px;">
</colgroup>
<tbody>
<tr>
<th data-highlight-colour=3D"#f5f5f5" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Field Name</p></th>
<th data-highlight-colour=3D"#f5f5f5" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Type</p></th>
<th data-highlight-colour=3D"#f5f5f5" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Validation &amp; Requirements</p></th>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>First Name*</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Text</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Only letters and spaces; no special characters</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Last Name*</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Text</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Same as First Name</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Company Name</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Text</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Optional</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Email*</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Email</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Valid format; no spaces; no consecutive dots</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Contact*</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Numeric</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Must be a 10-digit number</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<p><strong>Action:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Clicks <strong>Register</strong> to submit the form.</p></li>
</ul>
<p><strong>System Actions:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Sends a <strong>verification email</strong> to the Agent's email address=
.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Agent gains access to a limited dashboard.</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h4 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-5.Trigger:"><strong>5. Trigger:</strong></h4>
<p>Manual initiation by the user via the Agent registration form.</p>
<hr>
<h4 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-6.Pre-Condition:"><strong>6. Pre-Condition:</strong>=
</h4>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Agent must not already be registered.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Must have a valid email and contact number.</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h4 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-7.Post-Condition:"><strong>7. Post-Condition:</stron=
g></h4>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Agent profile is stored in the system.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Status set to <strong>Pending</strong> after email verification.</p></li=
>
<li>
<p>Awaiting further action (e.g., Client linking or approval process).</p><=
/li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h4 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-8.BusinessRules:.7"><strong>8. Business Rules:</stro=
ng></h4>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Email and contact number must be unique per agent.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Status transitions:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Pending</strong>: Email verified, awaiting Client linkage or app=
roval.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Active</strong>: Approved and operational.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Inactive</strong>: Access revoked or paused.</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p>Duplicate agent entries must be prevented.</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h4 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-9.Integration:"><strong>9. Integration:</strong></h4=
>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>User Management System</strong>: To store Agent profiles.</p></l=
i>
<li>
<p><strong>Notification System</strong>: For verification alerts.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>RBAC</strong>: To assign limited access roles to Agents.</p></li=
>
<li>
<p><strong>Email Service</strong>: To send verification emails.</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h4 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-10.Screens:.3"><strong>10. Screens:</strong></h4>
<p><strong>A. Client Agent Registration Page:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Input Fields: First Name, Last Name, Company Name, Email, Contact</p></l=
i>
<li>
<p>Button: <strong>Register</strong></p></li>
</ul><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper c=
onfluence-embedded-manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image ima=
ge-center" alt=3D"image-20250731-191051.png" width=3D"468" loading=3D"lazy"=
