 data-media-type=3D"file" height=3D"291"></span>
<p></p>
</div>
</div>
<div id=3D"expander-1402668898" class=3D"expand-container">
<div id=3D"expander-control-1402668898" class=3D"expand-control">
<span class=3D"expand-control-icon"><img style=3D"vertical-align:middle;" c=
lass=3D"expand-control-image" src=3D"f21dae11798d2af9ea1168a5798afeb45451aa=
fce182619f3dbe43f2e8b53628" width=3D"16" height=3D"16"></span><span class=
=3D"expand-control-text">2. Authorization Listing Page</span>
</div>
<div id=3D"expander-content-1402668898" class=3D"expand-content">
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-1.Interface:.32"><strong>1. Interface:</strong></h3>
<p><strong>Authorization Listing Page =E2=86=92 Authorization Dashboard</st=
rong></p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-2.Role:.32"><strong>2. Role:</strong></h3>
<p><strong>Client Agent</strong></p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-3.Description:.33"><strong>3. Description:</strong><=
/h3>
<p>This functionality enables Client Agents to view and manage authorizatio=
n requests sent to various Clients. The listing page provides a tabular vie=
w of all requests, including their current status, and supports filtering, =
searching, and action-taking capabilities.</p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-4.AuthorizationListingFlow(Image_2):"><strong>4. Aut=
horization Listing Flow (Image_2):</strong></h3>
<p>Upon navigating to the <strong>Authorization</strong> section:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>A table displays all authorization requests with the following columns:<=
/p>
<p>Column Name Description <strong>Client Name</strong> Name of the client =
to whom the request was sent <strong>Client Email</strong> Email address of=
 the client <strong>Status</strong> Current status of the request: Pending,=
 Approved, Rejected <strong>Actions</strong> Buttons/links to view or modif=
y the request</p></li>
<li>
<p>A <strong>search bar</strong> labeled =E2=80=9CVenue Name / Venue Code=
=E2=80=9D allows keyword-based search.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Filter buttons</strong> are available to view requests by status=
:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>All</p></li>
<li>
<p>Pending</p></li>
<li>
<p>Approved</p></li>
<li>
<p>Rejected</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Pagination controls</strong> are available at the bottom right t=
o navigate through multiple pages.</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-5.Trigger:.1"><strong>5. Trigger:</strong></h3>
<p>Automatic display upon accessing the Authorization section from the dash=
board.</p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-6.Pre-Condition:.1"><strong>6. Pre-Condition:</stron=
g></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>User must be logged in as a Client Agent.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Authorization requests must exist in the system.</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-7.Post-Condition:.1"><strong>7. Post-Condition:</str=
ong></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Authorization requests are displayed with current status.</p></li>
<li>
<p>User can search, filter, and take actions on requests.</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-8.BusinessRules:.8"><strong>8. Business Rules:</stro=
ng></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Only Client Agents can access this page.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Status values are system-defined and color-coded:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Pending</strong>: Request sent, awaiting client response.</p></l=
i>
<li>
<p><strong>Approved</strong>: Request accepted by client.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Rejected</strong>: Request declined by client.</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p>Search must support partial matches for venue name/code.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Filters must update the table dynamically.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Actions must be role-restricted and context-aware.</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-9.Integration:.1"><strong>9. Integration:</strong></=
h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Authorization Management System</strong>: To fetch and update re=
quest data.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>User Management System</strong>: To validate user roles and perm=
issions.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Notification System</strong>: To alert users of status changes.<=
/p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-10.Screens:.4"><strong>10. Screens:</strong></h3>
<p><strong>A. Authorization Listing Page (Image_2):</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Table Columns: Client Name, Client Email, Status, Actions</p></li>
<li>
<p>Filters: All, Pending, Approved, Rejected</p></li>
<li>
<p>Search Bar: Venue Name / Venue Code</p></li>
<li>
<p>Pagination: Bottom right corner</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<p>Would you like me to help define the <strong>action button behavior</str=
ong> (e.g., what happens when =E2=80=9CView=E2=80=9D or =E2=80=9CModify=E2=
=80=9D is clicked), or draft the <strong>API endpoints</strong> for this pa=
ge next?</p>
</div>
</div>
<div id=3D"expander-1228995627" class=3D"expand-container">
<div id=3D"expander-control-1228995627" class=3D"expand-control">
<span class=3D"expand-control-icon"><img style=3D"vertical-align:middle;" c=
lass=3D"expand-control-image" src=3D"f21dae11798d2af9ea1168a5798afeb45451aa=
fce182619f3dbe43f2e8b53628" width=3D"16" height=3D"16"></span><span class=
=3D"expand-control-text">3. Authorization Request Page</span>
</div>
<div id=3D"expander-content-1228995627" class=3D"expand-content">
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-1.Interface:.33"><strong>1. Interface:</strong></h3>
<p><strong>Authorization Request Page =E2=86=92 Authorization Listing Dashb=
oard</strong></p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-2.Role:.33"><strong>2. Role:</strong></h3>
<p><strong>Client Agent</strong></p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-3.Description:.34"><strong>3. Description:</strong><=
/h3>
<p>This functionality allows Client Agents to initiate authorization reques=
ts by entering the email addresses of Clients. The system validates the ema=
il format and sends a request to the specified Clients. These requests then=
 appear in the Authorization Listing Page with their respective statuses.</=
p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-4.AuthorizationRequestFlow:"><strong>4. Authorizatio=
n Request Flow:</strong></h3>
<p>Client Agent navigates to the <strong>Request Authorization</strong> pag=
e.</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Page displays a section titled <strong>"Enter Client Email"</strong>.</p=
></li>
<li>
<p>Instruction: <em>"Enter a valid client email to send a request."</em></p=
></li>
<li>
<p>Input Field(s): One or more email addresses (e.g., <code>kamal_jeet@hubb=
lehox.com</code>, <code>sudhanva_kimaye@hubblehox.com</code>)</p></li>
<li>
<p>Buttons:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Discard</strong>: Clears the input fields.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Request Authorization</strong>: Submits the request.</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<p><strong>System Actions:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Validates email format.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Sends authorization request to the entered email(s).</p></li>
<li>
<p>Adds entries to the Authorization Listing Page with <strong>Pending</str=
ong> status.</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-5.Trigger:.2"><strong>5. Trigger:</strong></h3>
<p>Manual initiation by the Client Agent via the Request Authorization form=
.</p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-6.Pre-Condition:.2"><strong>6. Pre-Condition:</stron=
g></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>User must be logged in as a Client Agent.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Entered email must be in valid format.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Email must not already have an active or pending authorization request.<=
/p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-7.Post-Condition:.2"><strong>7. Post-Condition:</str=
ong></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Authorization request is sent to the specified Client(s).</p></li>
<li>
<p>Request appears in the Authorization Listing Page with status <strong>Pe=
nding</strong>.</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-8.BusinessRules:.9"><strong>8. Business Rules:</stro=
ng></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Only valid email formats are accepted.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Duplicate requests to the same email are prevented unless previous reque=
st is <strong>Rejected</strong> or <strong>Inactive</strong>.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Status transitions:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Pending</strong>: Request sent, awaiting client response.</p></l=
i>
<li>
<p><strong>Approved</strong>: Request accepted by client.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Rejected</strong>: Request declined by client.</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p>Multiple email entries allowed in a single request.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Only Client Agents can initiate authorization requests.</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-9.Integration:.2"><strong>9. Integration:</strong></=
h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Authorization Management System</strong>: To create and track re=
quests.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Notification System</strong>: To notify Clients of incoming requ=
ests.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>User Management System</strong>: To validate roles and email own=
ership.</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-10.Screens:.5"><strong>10. Screens:</strong></h3>
<p><strong>A. Authorization Request Page:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Input Field: Client Email</p></li>
<li>
<p>Buttons: Discard, Request Authorization</p></li>
<li>
<p>Instructional Text: =E2=80=9CEnter a valid client email to send a reques=
t=E2=80=9D</p></li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
<p></p>
<h2 id=3D"VBSAMega:BRD-4.Non-FunctionalRequirements"><strong>4. Non-Functio=
nal Requirements</strong></h2>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"760" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"6f=
004349-08dd-4c1f-8fcb-dcdd180e679c" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr>
<th data-highlight-colour=3D"#f5f5f5" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Category</p></th>
<th data-highlight-colour=3D"#f5f5f5" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Requirement</p></th>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Performance</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Pages (e.g., calendar, booking, dashboard) should load within 2 seconds.=
</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Scalability</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>System should support onboarding of thousands of venues and users.</p></=
td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Security</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Role-Based Access Control (RBAC), encrypted data transmission, secure lo=
gin.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Usability</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Interfaces must be intuitive, mobile-responsive, and accessible.</p></td=
>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Availability</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Platform should maintain 99.9% uptime with failover support.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Maintainability</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Modular design to allow easy updates and feature additions.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><strong>Compliance</strong></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Adherence to data protection laws (e.g., GDPR, IT Act), audit logging.</=
p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<hr>
    </div>
</body>
